   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "angles = {3/5, -2/7, 4/9};\n(* global rotations acting on the left covector; generators as in the L=1 vacLof *)\nrotL[True] = MatrixExp[angles[[1]] EE[1, 2]] . MatrixExp[angles[[2]] EE[1, 3]] . MatrixExp[angles[[3]] EE[2, 3]];\nrotL[False] = MatrixExp[angles[[1]] EE[2, 1]] . MatrixExp[angles[[2]] EE[3, 1]] . MatrixExp[angles[[3]] EE[3, 2]];\nsiteRot[\\[Alpha]_, True] := MatrixExp[angles[[1]] Ee[\\[Alpha]][1, 2]] . MatrixExp[angles[[2]] Ee[\\[Alpha]][1, 3]] . MatrixExp[angles[[3]] Ee[\\[Alpha]][2, 3]];\nsiteRot[\\[Alpha]_, False] := MatrixExp[angles[[1]] Ee[\\[Alpha]][2, 1]] . MatrixExp[angles[[2]] Ee[\\[Alpha]][3, 1]] . MatrixExp[angles[[3]] Ee[\\[Alpha]][3, 2]];\n(* tensor product of vectors, flattened with site 1 as the slow index *)\nkron[a_, b_] := Flatten[KroneckerProduct[a, b]];\nvac[hwQ_] := kron[ext[1, hwQ], ext[2, hwQ]] . rotL[hwQ];\n(* per-site factors of the (product) vacuum *)\nvacSite[\\[Alpha]_, hwQ_] := ext[\\[Alpha], hwQ] . siteRot[\\[Alpha], hwQ];\n{vac[True] == kron[vacSite[1, True], vacSite[2, True]], vac[False] == kron[vacSite[1, False], vacSite[2, False]]}",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"677717\" data-output-id=\"35\" data-out-n=\"443\" data-sub-idx=\"11\" data-output-format=\"WLLatex\" data-output-is-graphics=\"0\" data-cell-idx=\"10\" data-sub-start=\"11\" data-sub-end=\"11\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[443]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered\" data-page-width-em=\"22\" data-latex-b64=\"XGxlZnRce1xtYXRocm17VHJ1ZX0sXG1hdGhybXtUcnVlfVxyaWdodFx9\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">{</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">True</span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">True</span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">}</span></span></span></span></span></span></div></div></div>",
       "mime": "x-application/wolfram-language-html"
      },
      {
       "data": "Out[443]= \\left\\{\\mathrm{True},\\mathrm{True}\\right\\}",
       "mime": "text/plain"
      }
     ],
     "id": "2e098a56-5d6c-41a2-902c-275bbc2f2457"
    }
   ],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* a covector on C^3 (x) C^8 is a product state iff its 3x8 reshaping has rank 1;\n   then compare each factor with the per-site rotated hw / lw vacuum (\"yes\" = proportional) *)\npropQ[a_, b_] := If[MatrixRank[{a, b}] == 1, \"yes\", \"no\"];\nfactorInfo[vec_] := Module[{m = ArrayReshape[vec, {d1, d2}], r, f1, f2},\n   r = MatrixRank[m];\n   If[r != 1, {r, \"-\", \"-\", \"-\", \"-\"},\n    f2 = First@Select[m, Max[Abs[#]] > 0 &]; f1 = First@Select[Transpose[m], Max[Abs[#]] > 0 &];\n    {1, propQ[f1, vacSite[1, True]], propQ[f1, vacSite[1, False]], propQ[f2, vacSite[2, True]], propQ[f2, vacSite[2, False]]}]];",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## Survey: which vacuum × tower × site localizes?\n\nEach row applies one tower operator at one site's evaluation point to a vacuum. Columns: rank of the 3×8 reshaping (1 = product state); if rank 1, whether the site-2 factor is $\\propto$ (hw₂, lw₂) rotated vacuum (rank 1 = yes), and the same for the site-1 factor.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* evaluation points: unshifted tower at theta_n, shifted tower at theta_n + h Lambda_n1 *)\npts = <|{\"t\", 1} -> th[1], {\"t\", 2} -> th[2], {\"tS\", 1} -> th[1] + hh \\[CapitalLambda][1][[1]], {\"tS\", 2} -> th[2] + hh \\[CapitalLambda][2][[1]]|>;\nopsOf[\"t\", u_] := {\"t10\" -> tR[{1, 0}][u], \"t11\" -> tR[{1, 1}][u], \"t20\" -> tR[{2, 0}][u], \"t21\" -> tR[{2, 1}][u], \"t20.t10^-1\" -> tR[{2, 0}][u] . Inverse[tR[{1, 0}][u]]};\nopsOf[\"tS\", u_] := {\"t10\" -> tSR[{1, 0}][u], \"t11\" -> tSR[{1, 1}][u], \"t20\" -> tSR[{2, 0}][u], \"t21\" -> tSR[{2, 1}][u], \"t20.t10^-1\" -> tSR[{2, 0}][u] . Inverse[tSR[{1, 0}][u]]};\nrowOf[hwQ_, tw_, site_, op_] := Module[{v = vac[hwQ] . op[[2]]},\n   Join[{If[hwQ, \"hw\", \"lw\"], tw, site, op[[1]]}, If[Max[Abs[v]] == 0, {\"zero\", \"-\", \"-\", \"-\", \"-\"}, factorInfo[v]]]];\nsurvey = Flatten[Table[rowOf[hwQ, tw, site, #] & /@ Quiet[opsOf[tw, pts[{tw, site}]]], {hwQ, {True, False}}, {tw, {\"t\", \"tS\"}}, {site, {1, 2}}], 3];\nGrid[Prepend[survey, {\"vacuum\", \"tower\", \"at site\", \"op\", \"rank\", \"f1~hw1\", \"f1~lw1\", \"f2~hw2\", \"f2~lw2\"}], Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
