  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "### Findings (2026-09-25, numerical point above)\n\n- **Original tower `t` at $\\theta_1$:** `t10` gives a product state whose site-2 factor is the site-2 vacuum (hw or lw, matching the vacuum used) — the known site-1 localization. `t11`, `t20`, `t21` vanish on the vacuum here (site 1 is only the fundamental).\n- **`t` at $\\theta_2$:** nothing factorizes (rank 2–3).\n- **Shifted tower `tS` at $\\theta_2 + h\\Lambda_{2,1} = \\theta_2+2h$:** `t10`, `t11`, `t20`, `t21` all give **product states whose site-1 factor is the site-1 vacuum**, and whose site-2 factor is not the vacuum, i.e. genuine excitations **localized on site 2**. This holds for both the rotated hw and the rotated lw vacuum.\n- **Exception:** the composite `t20.t10^-1` (the base of the old $\\{\\{2\\},\\cdot\\}$ states) at $\\theta_2+2h$ is *not* a product (rank 3).\n- **`tS` at $\\theta_1+h$:** nothing factorizes.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "# Adjoint ⊗ adjoint\n\nSame point and angles, but $\\Lambda_1=\\{2,1,0\\}$ as well (dim 64). Everything memoized on the site-1 rep is cleared and redefined.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "ClearAll[Ee, EE, T, TG, QMG, tG, rotL];\n\\[CapitalLambda][1] = {2, 1, 0}; \\[CapitalLambda][2] = {2, 1, 0};\nd1 = dim[\\[CapitalLambda][1]]; d2 = dim[\\[CapitalLambda][2]];\nEe[\\[Alpha]_][i_, j_] := Ee[\\[Alpha]][i, j] = JJ[i, j, \\[CapitalLambda][\\[Alpha]]];\nEE[i_, j_] := EE[i, j] = KroneckerProduct[Ee[1][i, j], IdentityMatrix[d2]] + KroneckerProduct[IdentityMatrix[d1], Ee[2][i, j]];\nT[{i_, j_}][u_] := T[{i, j}][u] = Sum[KroneckerProduct[\\[ScriptCapitalL][1][i, k][u - th[1]], \\[ScriptCapitalL][2][k, j][u - th[2]]], {k, 3}];\nTG[{i_, j_}][u_] := TG[{i, j}][u] = Sum[T[{i, k}][u] G[[k, j]], {k, 3}];\nQMG[Ii_, Jj_][u_] := \n  QMG[Ii, Jj][u] = \n   Sum[Signature[Permutations[Ii][[\\[Sigma]]]] (Dot @@ (TG[#][u + hh - hh Last[Flatten[Position[Transpose[{Permutations[Ii][[\\[Sigma]]], Jj}], #]]]] & /@ Transpose[{Permutations[Ii][[\\[Sigma]]], Jj}])), {\\[Sigma], 1, Length[Permutations[Ii]]}];\ntG[a_][u_] := tG[a][u] = Sum[QMG[Ii, Ii][u], {Ii, Subsets[Range[3], {a}]}];\nrotL[True] = MatrixExp[angles[[1]] EE[1, 2]] . MatrixExp[angles[[2]] EE[1, 3]] . MatrixExp[angles[[3]] EE[2, 3]];\nrotL[False] = MatrixExp[angles[[1]] EE[2, 1]] . MatrixExp[angles[[2]] EE[3, 1]] . MatrixExp[angles[[3]] EE[3, 2]];\n{d1 d2, vac[True] == kron[vacSite[1, True], vacSite[2, True]], vac[False] == kron[vacSite[1, False], vacSite[2, False]]}",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"677717\" data-output-id=\"37\" data-out-n=\"463\" data-sub-idx=\"11\" data-output-format=\"WLLatex\" data-output-is-graphics=\"0\" data-cell-idx=\"16\" data-sub-start=\"13\" data-sub-end=\"13\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[463]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered\" data-page-width-em=\"21\" data-latex-b64=\"XGxlZnRcezY0LFxtYXRocm17VHJ1ZX0sXG1hdGhybXtUcnVlfVxyaWdodFx9\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">{</span><span class=\"mord\">64</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">True</span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">True</span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">}</span></span></span></span></span></span></div></div></div>",
       "mime": "x-application/wolfram-language-html"
