  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "### Findings, adjoint ⊗ adjoint (same point)\n\n- **`t` at $\\theta_1$ (control):** `t11`, `t21` → product with site-2 factor = vac₂ (site-1 localization, as known). `t10`, `t20` rank 2; `t20.t10^-1` rank 7.\n- **`tS` at $\\theta_2+2h$:** `t11`, `t21` → product with **site-1 factor = vac₁** (site-2 localization). `t10`, `t20` rank 2; `t20.t10^-1` rank 7.\n- Identical for rotated hw and rotated lw vacua. The site-2 pattern is the exact mirror of the site-1 one. In fund ⊗ adj, `t10`/`t20` also factorized, but that was an artifact of the small site-1 rep.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## Where does the ratio go? Localized combinations of the L=1-recipe states\n\nFor one site, take the 8 L=1-recipe states on the global vacuum: $1$, $R=t_{20}t_{10}^{-1}$, $t_{10}$, $t_{11}$, $Rt_{10}$, $Rt_{11}$, $Rt_{20}$, $Rt_{21}$ (site 1: `t` at $\\theta_1$; site 2: `tS` at $\\theta_2+2h$). Localized subspace: $\\langle\\text{any}|\\otimes\\langle 0_2|$ (site 1) or $\\langle 0_1|\\otimes\\langle\\text{any}|$ (site 2). Count how many independent combinations of the 8 lie in it, and read off the coefficients.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "recipe[tw_, u_, hwQ_] := Module[{t10, t11, t20, t21, R, v = vac[hwQ]},\n   {t10, t11, t20, t21} = Lookup[opsOf[tw, u], {\"t10\", \"t11\", \"t20\", \"t21\"}];\n   R = t20 . Inverse[t10];\n   <|\"1\" -> v, \"R\" -> v . R, \"t10\" -> v . t10, \"t11\" -> v . t11, \"R.t10\" -> v . R . t10, \"R.t11\" -> v . R . t11, \"R.t20\" -> v . R . t20, \"R.t21\" -> v . R . t21|>];\nlocSpace[1, hwQ_] := Table[kron[UnitVector[d1, k], vacSite[2, hwQ]], {k, d1}];\nlocSpace[2, hwQ_] := Table[kron[vacSite[1, hwQ], UnitVector[d2, k]], {k, d2}];\n(* null vectors (c, -d) of [S; V]^T give c.S = d.V, i.e. combinations of recipe states that are localized *)\nlocalCombos[site_, tw_, u_, hwQ_] := Module[{st = recipe[tw, u, hwQ], S, V, ns},\n   S = Values[st]; V = locSpace[site, hwQ];\n   ns = NullSpace[Transpose[Join[S, V]]];\n   {MatrixRank[S], Length[ns], RowReduce[ns[[All, 1 ;; Length[S]]]], Keys[st]}];\nlocAA = <|\"site 1 (t at th1)\" -> localCombos[1, \"t\", th[1], True], \"site 2 (tS at th2+2h)\" -> localCombos[2, \"tS\", th[2] + 2 hh, True]|>;\nGrid[Prepend[KeyValueMap[{#1, #2[[1]], #2[[2]]} &, locAA], {\"\", \"rank of 8 recipe states\", \"# localized combinations\"}], Frame -> All]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"677717\" data-output-id=\"39\" data-out-n=\"472\" data-sub-idx=\"6\" data-output-format=\"WLLatex\" data-output-is-graphics=\"0\" data-cell-idx=\"20\" data-sub-start=\"12\" data-sub-end=\"12\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[472]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered\" data-page-width-em=\"21\" data-latex-b64=\"XGJlZ2lue2FycmF5fXt8Y3xjfGN8fVxobGluZSAmIFx0ZXh0e3Jhbmsgb2YgOCByZWNpcGUgc3RhdGVzfSAmIFx0ZXh0e1wjIGxvY2FsaXplZCBjb21iaW5hdGlvbnN9XFxcaGxpbmVcdGV4dHtzaXRlIDEgKHQgYXQgdGgxKX0gJiA4ICYgM1xcXGhsaW5lXHRleHR7c2l0ZSAyICh0UyBhdCB0aDIrMmgpfSAmIDggJiAzXFxcaGxpbmVcZW5ke2FycmF5fQ==\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:3.64em;vertical-align:-1.55em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.09em;\"><span style=\"top:-4.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:4.05em;\"></span><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:3.6em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-1.55em;\"></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-4.21em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.01em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">site 1 (t at th1)</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-1.81em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"hei