  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* which combinations are localized (rows = RowReduced coefficient vectors over the 8 recipe states), and is vac.t21 just R.t11? *)\nModule[{s1 = recipe[\"t\", th[1], True], s2 = recipe[\"tS\", th[2] + 2 hh, True], v = vac[True]},\n Grid[{{\"site\", \"localized combinations\", \"rank{R.t11, vac.t21}\"},\n   {1, Map[Pick[locAA[[1, 4]], # , 1] &, locAA[[1, 3]]], MatrixRank[{s1[\"R.t11\"], v . tR[{2, 1}][th[1]]}]},\n   {2, Map[Pick[locAA[[2, 4]], #, 1] &, locAA[[2, 3]]], MatrixRank[{s2[\"R.t11\"], v . tSR[{2, 1}][th[2] + 2 hh]}]}}, Frame -> All]]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
