     "id": "7b5713df-9d53-467f-b921-5b1042789a3e"
    }
   ],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "### Findings\n\nOn **both** sites exactly 3 of the 8 recipe states localize, each on its own (no mixing): $1$, $t_{11}$, $R\\,t_{11}$; and $\\mathrm{vac}\\cdot t_{21} \\propto \\mathrm{vac}\\cdot R\\,t_{11}$. No combination involving $R$, $t_{10}$, $R t_{10}$, $R t_{20}$, $R t_{21}$ is localized — in this recipe span the ratio itself has **no** localized analogue, on either site.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "# Companion frame (adjoint ⊗ adjoint)\n\nCompanion twist $G=\\begin{pmatrix}\\chi_1&\\chi_2&\\chi_3\\\\1&0&0\\\\0&1&0\\end{pmatrix}$ at generic numerical $\\chi_a$, **unrotated** vacua (as in `Companion-B-C-diagonalize.wb`, where $\\langle x|$ starts from the lowest-weight vector). Same localized-combination count as above.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "ClearAll[T, TG, QMG, tG];\nG = {{2, -3, 5}, {1, 0, 0}, {0, 1, 0}};\nT[{i_, j_}][u_] := T[{i, j}][u] = Sum[KroneckerProduct[\\[ScriptCapitalL][1][i, k][u - th[1]], \\[ScriptCapitalL][2][k, j][u - th[2]]], {k, 3}];\nTG[{i_, j_}][u_] := TG[{i, j}][u] = Sum[T[{i, k}][u] G[[k, j]], {k, 3}];\nQMG[Ii_, Jj_][u_] := \n  QMG[Ii, Jj][u] = \n   Sum[Signature[Permutations[Ii][[\\[Sigma]]]] (Dot @@ (TG[#][u + hh - hh Last[Flatten[Position[Transpose[{Permutations[Ii][[\\[Sigma]]], Jj}], #]]]] & /@ Transpose[{Permutations[Ii][[\\[Sigma]]], Jj}])), {\\[Sigma], 1, Length[Permutations[Ii]]}];\ntG[a_][u_] := tG[a][u] = Sum[QMG[Ii, Ii][u], {Ii, Subsets[Range[3], {a}]}];\n(* recipe / localized-subspace test for an arbitrary product vacuum f1 (x) f2 *)\nrecipeV[tw_, u_, v_] := Module[{t10, t11, t20, t21, R},\n   {t10, t11, t20, t21} = Lookup[opsOf[tw, u], {\"t10\", \"t11\", \"t20\", \"t21\"}];\n   R = t20 . Inverse[t10];\n   <|\"1\" -> v, \"R\" -> v . R, \"t10\" -> v . t10, \"t11\" -> v . t11, \"R.t10\" -> v . R . t10, \"R.t11\" -> v . R . t11, \"R.t20\" -> v . R . t20, \"R.t21\" -> v . R . t21|>];\nlocCombosV[site_, tw_, u_, f1_, f2_] := Module[{st = recipeV[tw, u, kron[f1, f2]], S, V, ns},\n   S = Values[st];\n   V = If[site == 1, Table[kron[UnitVector[d1, k], f2], {k, d1}], Table[kron[f1, UnitVector[d2, k]], {k, d2}]];\n   ns = NullSpace[Transpose[Join[S, V]]];\n   {MatrixRank[S], Length[ns], Map[Pick[Keys[st], #, 1] &, RowReduce[ns[[All, 1 ;; Length[S]]]] /. x_?NumericQ /; x != 0 :> 1]}];\ncompRows = Flatten[Table[With[{f = ext[1, hwQ], g = ext[2, hwQ]}, {If[hwQ, \"hw\", \"lw\"], site, tw, Sequence @@ locCombosV[site, tw, If[tw == \"t\", th[site], th[site] + 2 hh], f, g]}], {hwQ, {False, True}}, {site, {1, 2}}, {tw, {\"t\", \"tS\"}}], 2];\nGrid[Prepend[compRows, {\"vacuum\", \"site\", \"tower\", \"rank\", \"# localized\", \"localized combinations\"}], Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
