   "value": "### Findings, companion frame\n\n| vacuum | site | tower | localized (each on its own) |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| lw | 1 | `t` at $\\theta_1$ | $1$, $R$, $t_{11}$, $Rt_{11}$ |\n| lw | 2 | `tS` at $\\theta_2+2h$ | $1$, $R$, $t_{11}$, $Rt_{11}$ |\n| hw | 1 | `t` at $\\theta_1$ | $1$, $t_{11}$, $Rt_{11}$ |\n| hw | 2 | `tS` at $\\theta_2+2h$ | $1$, $t_{11}$, $Rt_{11}$ |\n| any | other site | wrong tower | only $1$ |\n\nWith the **unrotated lowest-weight** vacuum the ratio **does** localize: $\\langle 0|\\,t^S_{20}t^{S\\,-1}_{10}(\\theta_2+2h)$ is $\\langle 0_1|\\otimes(\\cdot)$, the exact mirror of $\\langle 0|\\,t_{20}t_{10}^{-1}(\\theta_1) = (\\cdot)\\otimes\\langle 0_2|$. The diagonal frame with rotated vacua loses $R$.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "# From companion to diagonal frame by a global rotation\n\n$G_c = P\\,G_d\\,P^{-1}$ with $P$ the Vandermonde matrix of eigenvectors $(z_a^2, z_a, 1)^T$ and $\\chi$ from $\\prod_a(\\lambda-z_a)=\\lambda^3-\\chi_1\\lambda^2-\\chi_2\\lambda-\\chi_3$. Invariance of the Lax operator gives $t_c = \\Pi(Q)\\,t_d\\,\\Pi(Q)^{-1}$ for the global representation $\\Pi=\\Pi_1\\otimes\\Pi_2$ of a suitable $Q\\in\\{P^{\\pm1},\\dots\\}$ (fixed below by direct check). Then\n$$\\langle 0|\\,\\mathcal O_c = (f_1\\otimes f_2) \\;\\Longrightarrow\\; \\langle 0|\\Pi(Q)\\,\\mathcal O_d = (f_1\\Pi_1(Q))\\otimes(f_2\\Pi_2(Q)),$$\nso the diagonal-frame localizing vacuum is $\\langle\\Omega| = \\langle \\mathrm{lw}|\\,\\Pi(Q)$.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* twist-parametrised monodromy and towers, so both frames can live side by side *)\nClearAll[TGp, QMGp, tGp, towers];\nTGp[Gm_][{i_, j_}][u_] := TGp[Gm][{i, j}][u] = Sum[T[{i, k}][u] Gm[[k, j]], {k, 3}];\nQMGp[Gm_][Ii_, Jj_][u_] := QMGp[Gm][Ii, Jj][u] = Sum[Signature[Permutations[Ii][[\\[Sigma]]]] (Dot @@ (TGp[Gm][#][u + hh - hh Last[Flatten[Position[Transpose[{Permutations[Ii][[\\[Sigma]]], Jj}], #]]]] & /@ Transpose[{Permutations[Ii][[\\[Sigma]]], Jj}])), {\\[Sigma], 1, Length[Permutations[Ii]]}];\ntGp[Gm_][a_][u_] := tGp[Gm][a][u] = Sum[QMGp[Gm][Ii, Ii][u], {Ii, Subsets[Range[3], {a}]}];\ntowers[Gm_, \"t\", u_] := <|\"t10\" -> tGp[Gm][1][u], \"t11\" -> tGp[Gm][2][u], \"t20\" -> tGp[Gm][1][u] . tGp[Gm][1][u + hh] - tGp[Gm][2][u + hh], \"t21\" -> tGp[Gm][2][u] . tGp[Gm][1][u + hh] - tGp[Gm][3][u + hh]|>;\ntowers[Gm_, \"tS\", u_] := <|\"t10\" -> tGp[Gm][1][u], \"t11\" -> tGp[Gm][2][u + hh], \"t20\" -> tGp[Gm][1][u - hh] . tGp[Gm][1][u] - tGp[Gm][2][u], \"t21\" -> tGp[Gm][2][u + hh] . tGp[Gm][1][u - hh] - tGp[Gm][3][u + hh]|>;\nzs = {2, -3, 5};\nGd = DiagonalMatrix[zs];\nchis = {Total[zs], -(zs[[1]] zs[[2]] + zs[[1]] zs[[3]] + zs[[2]] zs[[3]]), Times @@ zs};\nGc = {chis, {1, 0, 0}, {0, 1, 0}};\nPv = Transpose[{#^2, #, 1} & /@ zs];\n{Gc == Pv . Gd . Inverse[Pv], chis}",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"677717\" data-output-id=\"44\" data-out-n=\"515\" data-sub-idx=\"12\" data-output-format=\"WLLatex\" data-output-is-graphics=\"0\" data-cell-idx=\"27\" data-sub-start=\"12\" data-sub-end=\"12\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[515]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered\" data-page-width-em=\"21\" data-latex-b64=\"XGxlZnRce1xtYXRocm17VHJ1ZX0sXGxlZnRcezQsMTEsLTMwXHJpZ2h0XH1ccmlnaHRcfQ==\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">{</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">True</span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">{</span><span class=\"mord\">4</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">11</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord\">30</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">}</span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">}</span></span></span></span></span></span></div></div></div>",
       "mime": "x-application/wolfram-language-html"
      },
      {
       "data": "Out[515]= \\left\\{\\mathrm{True},\\left\\{4,11,-30\\right\\}\\right\\}",
       "mime": "text/plain"
      }
     ],
     "id": "1c458362-d613-4587-baf5-81224b43a61f"
    }
   ],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* global representation of a GL(3) element via g = L.D.U (unipotent logs + torus weights) *)\nldu[g_] := Module[{l21, l31, l32, dd1, dd2, dd3, u12, u13, u23, L, D, U, s},\n   L = {{1, 0, 0}, {l21, 1, 0}, {l31, l32, 1}}; U = {{1, u12, u13}, {0, 1, u23}, {0, 0, 1}}; D = DiagonalMatrix[{dd1, dd2, dd3}];\n   s = First@Solve[Thread[Flatten[L . D . U - g] == 0], {l21, l31, l32, dd1, dd2, dd3, u12, u13, u23}];\n   {L, D, U} /. s];\nPiSite[\\[Alpha]_, g_] := Module[{L, D, U, lg, ug, wts},\n   {L, D, U} = ldu[g];\n   lg = (L - IdentityMatrix[3]) - (L - IdentityMatrix[3]) . (L - IdentityMatrix[3])/2;\n   ug = (U - IdentityMatrix[3]) - (U - IdentityMatrix[3]) . (U - IdentityMatrix[3])/2;\n   wts = Transpose[Diagonal /@ Table[Ee[\\[Alpha]][i, i], {i, 3}]];\n   MatrixExp[Sum[lg[[i, j]] Ee[\\[Alpha]][i, j], {i, 3}, {j, 3}]] . DiagonalMatrix[Times @@ (Diagonal[D]^#) & /@ wts] . MatrixExp[Sum[ug[[i, j]] Ee[\\[Alpha]][i, j], {i, 3}, {j, 3}]]];\nPiTot[g_] := KroneckerProduct[PiSite[1, g], PiSite[2, g]];\n(* homomorphism check on one site, then find which Q intertwines the transfer matrices *)\ng1 = {{1, 2, 0}, {1/3, 1, 1}, {2, 0, 1}}; g2 = {{2, 1, 1}, {0, 1, 3}, {1, 1, 1}};\nhomQ = PiSite[2, g1 . g2] == PiSite[2, g1] . PiSite[2, g2];\ncands = <|\"P\" -> Pv, \"P^-1\" -> Inverse[Pv], \"P^T\" -> Transpose[Pv], \"P^-T\" -> Inverse[Transpose[Pv]]|>;\nuTest = 3/7;\nintertw = Map[Function[Q, With[{PQ = PiTot[Q]}, tGp[Gc][1][uTest] == PQ . tGp[Gd][1][uTest] . Inverse[PQ]]], cands];\n{homQ, intertw}",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"677717\" data-output-id=\"45\" data-out-n=\"524\" data-sub-idx=\"10\" data-output-format=\"WLLatex\" data-output-is-graphics=\"0\" data-cell-idx=\"28\" data-sub-start=\"18\" data-sub-end=\"18\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[524]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered\" data-page-width-em=\"21\" data-line-broken=\"1\" data-latex-b64=\"\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:6em;vertical-align:-2.75em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"col-align-r\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:3.25em;\"><span style=\"top:-5.25em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.84em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.75em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.84em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.25em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.84em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-0.75em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.84em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.75em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"col-align-l\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:3.25em;\"><span style=\"top:-5.41em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">{</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">True</span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.91em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">⟨</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:-0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.41em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">∣</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">P</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">True</span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">P</span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.25em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˆ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">-1</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">False</span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-0.91em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">P</span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.25em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˆ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">T</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">False</span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">P</span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.25em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˆ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">-T</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">False</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:-0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mclose\">⟩</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">}</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.75em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div></div></div>",
       "mime": "x-application/wolfram-language-html"
