  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* diagonal-frame vacuum = companion lw vacuum rotated by Pi(P); per-site factors rotate separately *)\nP1 = PiSite[1, Pv]; P2 = PiSite[2, Pv];\n\\[CapitalOmega]1 = ext[1, False] . P1; \\[CapitalOmega]2 = ext[2, False] . P2;\n\\[CapitalOmega] = kron[\\[CapitalOmega]1, \\[CapitalOmega]2];\nrecipeG[Gm_, tw_, u_, v_] := Module[{o = towers[Gm, tw, u], R},\n   R = o[\"t20\"] . Inverse[o[\"t10\"]];\n   <|\"1\" -> v, \"R\" -> v . R, \"t10\" -> v . o[\"t10\"], \"t11\" -> v . o[\"t11\"], \"R.t10\" -> v . R . o[\"t10\"], \"R.t11\" -> v . R . o[\"t11\"], \"R.t20\" -> v . R . o[\"t20\"], \"R.t21\" -> v . R . o[\"t21\"]|>];\nlocG[Gm_, site_, tw_, u_, f1_, f2_] := Module[{st = recipeG[Gm, tw, u, kron[f1, f2]], S, V, ns},\n   S = Values[st];\n   V = If[site == 1, Table[kron[UnitVector[d1, k], f2], {k, d1}], Table[kron[f1, UnitVector[d2, k]], {k, d2}]];\n   ns = NullSpace[Transpose[Join[S, V]]];\n   {Length[ns], Map[Pick[Keys[st], #, 1] &, RowReduce[ns[[All, 1 ;; Length[S]]]] /. x_?NumericQ /; x != 0 :> 1]}];\ndiagRows = {{\"site 1, t at th1\", Sequence @@ locG[Gd, 1, \"t\", th[1], \\[CapitalOmega]1, \\[CapitalOmega]2]}, {\"site 2, tS at th2+2h\", Sequence @@ locG[Gd, 2, \"tS\", th[2] + 2 hh, \\[CapitalOmega]1, \\[CapitalOmega]2]}};\nGrid[Prepend[diagRows, {\"diagonal frame, vacuum <lw|Pi(P)\", \"# localized\", \"localized states\"}], Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
