  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* the transported statement: diagonal-frame state = companion-frame state . Pi(P), with each site factor rotated by Pi_n(P) *)\nModule[{c2 = recipeG[Gc, \"tS\", th[2] + 2 hh, kron[ext[1, False], ext[2, False]]], d2s = recipeG[Gd, \"tS\", th[2] + 2 hh, \\[CapitalOmega]], PP = KroneckerProduct[P1, P2]},\n Grid[Prepend[Table[{k, d2s[k] == c2[k] . PP, MatrixRank[ArrayReshape[d2s[k], {d1, d2}]], MatrixRank[{First@Select[Transpose[ArrayReshape[d2s[k], {d1, d2}]], Max[Abs[#]] > 0 &], \\[CapitalOmega]1}]}, {k, {\"R\", \"t11\", \"R.t11\"}}], {\"site-2 state\", \"= companion . Pi(P)\", \"rank\", \"rank{site-1 factor, Omega1}\"}], Frame -> All]]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
