  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* is each site factor Omega_n the L=1 'rotparams' vacuum <hw| e^{p1 E12} e^{p2 E13} e^{p3 E23} (p3 fixed by p1, p2, z) at the same twist? *)\nrotparamsN = {p3 -> (p2 (-z[1] + z[3]))/(p1 (z[2] - z[3]))} /. z[a_] :> zs[[a]];\nrpVac[\\[Alpha]_] := ext[\\[Alpha], True] . MatrixExp[p1 Ee[\\[Alpha]][1, 2]] . MatrixExp[p2 Ee[\\[Alpha]][1, 3]] . MatrixExp[p3 Ee[\\[Alpha]][2, 3]] /. rotparamsN;\n{Solve[Thread[rpVac[1] == c \\[CapitalOmega]1], {p1, p2, c}], Solve[Thread[rpVac[2] == c \\[CapitalOmega]2], {p1, p2, c}]}",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
