  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "### Findings: localization in the diagonal frame\n\n- $t_c = \\Pi(P)\\,t_d\\,\\Pi(P)^{-1}$ with $P$ the Vandermonde matrix of $G_c$ (checked; $P^{-1}$, $P^T$, $P^{-T}$ fail).\n- Diagonal-frame vacuum $\\langle\\Omega| = \\langle\\mathrm{lw}|\\Pi(P) = \\langle\\Omega_1|\\otimes\\langle\\Omega_2|$, and each $\\langle\\Omega_n|$ **is the L=1 `rotparams` vacuum** $\\langle\\mathrm{hw}|e^{p_1E_{12}}e^{p_2E_{13}}e^{p_3E_{23}}$ with $p_3 = p_2(z_3-z_1)/(p_1(z_2-z_3))$ (here $p_1=1$, $p_2=8/5$, overall scale $3/5$).\n- With that vacuum, in the diagonal frame: $\\langle\\Omega|\\{1, R, t_{11}, Rt_{11}\\}(\\theta_1)$ localize on site 1 and $\\langle\\Omega|\\{1, R^S, t^S_{11}, R^St^S_{11}\\}(\\theta_2+2h)$ localize on site 2, with site factors = companion ones $\\cdot\\,\\Pi_n(P)$.\n- The generic-angle diagonal test earlier lost $R$ because $p_3$ was not tied to $p_1,p_2$ by `rotparams`.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "# $1 + r\\,R$ as a one-site rotation (diagonal frame, rotparams vacuum)\n\nAt L=2, $\\langle k_1^{u/h}Q_1\\rangle$ with site-1 poles is the overlap with $\\langle v_1|\\otimes\\mathrm{vacL}$, $v_1=(1-k_1z_1)\\,e_1^Te^{p_1'E_{12}}e^{p_2E_{13}}e^{p_3E_{23}}$, $p_1'=p_1\\frac{1-k_1z_2}{1-k_1z_1}$ (`L2-mathcalA.tex`). Here: which rotation is $\\langle\\Omega|(1+rR)$ on site 1 ($R$ at $\\theta_1$), and $\\langle\\Omega|(1+rR^S)$ on site 2 ($R^S$ at $\\theta_2+2h$)? $\\nu$-normalised ratios: $R = t_{20}t_{10}^{-1}/\\nu_1(u+h)$, $R^S = t^S_{20}t^{S\\,-1}_{10}/\\nu_3(u-h)$, with $\\nu_n(u)=\\prod_s(u-\\theta_s-h\\Lambda_{s,n})$.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "nu[n_][u_] := Product[u - th[s] - hh \\[CapitalLambda][s][[n]], {s, 2}];\nRn1 = With[{o = towers[Gd, \"t\", th[1]]}, o[\"t20\"] . Inverse[o[\"t10\"]]/nu[1][th[1] + hh]];\nRn2 = With[{o = towers[Gd, \"tS\", th[2] + 2 hh]}, o[\"t20\"] . Inverse[o[\"t10\"]]/nu[3][th[2] + 2 hh - hh]];\n{f1, f2} = {rpVac[1], rpVac[2]} /. {p1 -> 1, p2 -> 8/5};\n(* site factor after acting with 1 + r R: rows/columns of the rank-1 reshaping *)\nsiteFactor[vec_, site_] := Module[{m = ArrayReshape[vec, {d1, d2}]}, If[site == 2, First@Select[m, Max[Abs[# /. r -> 1/7]] > 0 &], First@Select[Transpose[m], Max[Abs[# /. r -> 1/7]] > 0 &]]];\nv1r = kron[f1, f2] . (IdentityMatrix[d1 d2] + r Rn1);\nv2r = kron[f1, f2] . (IdentityMatrix[d1 d2] + r Rn2);\n(* check rank 1 at a few r, and the untouched site factor *)\n{Table[MatrixRank[ArrayReshape[v1r /. r -> rr, {d1, d2}]], {rr, {1/7, -3, 5/2}}], Table[MatrixRank[ArrayReshape[v2r /. r -> rr, {d1, d2}]], {rr, {1/7, -3, 5/2}}]}",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"677717\" data-output-id=\"50\" data-out-n=\"544\" data-sub-idx=\"9\" data-output-format=\"WLLatex\" data-output-is-graphics=\"0\" data-cell-idx=\"35\" data-sub-start=\"9\" data-sub-end=\"9\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[544]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered\" data-page-width-em=\"21\" data-latex-b64=\"XGJlZ2lue3BtYXRyaXh9MSAmIDEgJiAxXFwxICYgMSAmIDFcZW5ke3BtYXRyaXh9\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.4em;vertical-align:-0.95em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.45em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.61em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.41em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.95em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.45em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.61em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.41em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.95em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.45em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.61em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.41em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.95em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div></div></div>",
       "mime": "x-application/wolfram-language-html"
      },
      {
       "data": "Out[544]= \\begin{pmatrix}1 & 1 & 1\\\\1 & 1 & 1\\end{pmatrix}",
       "mime": "text/plain"
      }
     ],
     "id": "bc49a2b0-20fa-49fc-94cc-a10504c5ea76"
    }
   ],
   "metadata": {}
