  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* fit the moved factor to c e1 e^{a E12} e^{b E13} e^{cc E23}; the fixed factor is divided out exactly (v = f1 (x) w or w (x) f2) *)\nrotFit[\\[Alpha]_, w_] := Module[{a, b, cc, c, ans},\n   ans = Solve[Thread[c ext[\\[Alpha], True] . MatrixExp[a Ee[\\[Alpha]][1, 2]] . MatrixExp[b Ee[\\[Alpha]][1, 3]] . MatrixExp[cc Ee[\\[Alpha]][2, 3]] == w], {a, b, cc, c}];\n   Simplify[{a, b, cc, c} /. ans]];\ni1 = First@FirstPosition[f1, _?(# != 0 &)]; i2 = First@FirstPosition[f2, _?(# != 0 &)];\nw1 = ArrayReshape[v1r, {d1, d2}][[All, i2]]/f2[[i2]];\nw2 = ArrayReshape[v2r, {d1, d2}][[i1, All]]/f1[[i1]];\nfit1 = rotFit[1, w1]; fit2 = rotFit[2, w2];\nGrid[{{\"\", \"(p1, p2, p3, scale)\"}, {\"reference vacuum\", {1, 8/5, p3 /. rotparamsN /. {p1 -> 1, p2 -> 8/5}, 1}}, {\"site 1: <Omega|(1 + r R)\", fit1}, {\"site 2: <Omega|(1 + r R^S)\", fit2}, {\"z\", zs}}, Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
