  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* Baxter operators of L2-mathcalA.wb cell 5, in this notebook's names (nu[n] = prod_s (x - th_s - h Lambda_{s,n})) *)\nbaxDir[{t1_, t2_, t3_}, zz_][q_][x_] := zz nu[1][x] nu[1][x - hh] nu[1][x - 2 hh] q[x + hh] - (t1 /. u -> x) nu[1][x - hh] nu[1][x - 2 hh] q[x] + (t2 /. u -> x) nu[1][x - 2 hh] q[x - hh]/zz - (t3 /. u -> x) q[x - 2 hh]/zz^2;\nbaxDual[{t1_, t2_, t3_}, y_][g_][x_] := nu[3][x + hh] nu[3][x + 2 hh] nu[3][x + 3 hh] g[x] - y (t1 /. u -> x + hh) nu[3][x + 2 hh] nu[3][x + 3 hh] g[x + hh] + y^2 (t2 /. u -> x + 2 hh) nu[3][x + 3 hh] g[x + 2 hh] - y^3 (t3 /. u -> x + 3 hh) g[x + 3 hh];\nsolveMonic[op_, degree_] := Module[{c, x, q, eqs, aa, bb, sol, res},\n   q = Function[y, Evaluate[y^degree + Sum[c[m] y^m, {m, 0, degree - 1}]]];\n   eqs = CoefficientList[Expand[op[q][x]], x];\n   aa = Table[Coefficient[e, c[m]], {e, eqs}, {m, 0, degree - 1}]; bb = eqs /. c[_] -> 0;\n   sol = If[degree == 0, {}, LeastSquares[aa, -bb]];\n   res = If[degree == 0, bb, aa . sol + bb];\n   {Function[y, Evaluate[q[y] /. Thread[Table[c[m], {m, 0, degree - 1}] -> sol]]], Max[Abs[res]]/Max[Join[{1}, Abs@Flatten[{aa, bb}]]]}];\nlam1 = \\[CapitalLambda][1][[1]];\nqDir = Table[solveMonic[baxDir[tauPoly[[A]], N[zs[[1]], prec]], 2 lam1 - muOf[[A, 1]]], {A, 64}];\nqDual3 = Table[solveMonic[baxDual[tauPoly[[A]], 1/N[zs[[3]], prec]], muOf[[A, 3]]], {A, 64}];\n{\"max Baxter residual (q_1, q^3)\" -> N[Max[Join[qDir[[All, 2]], qDual3[[All, 2]]]], 3]}",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"677717\" data-output-id=\"54\" data-out-n=\"572\" data-sub-idx=\"7\" data-output-format=\"WLLatex\" data-output-is-graphics=\"0\" data-cell-idx=\"40\" data-sub-start=\"13\" data-sub-end=\"13\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[572]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered\" data-page-width-em=\"21\" data-latex-b64=\"XGxlZnRce1x0ZXh0e21heCBCYXh0ZXIgcmVzaWR1YWwgKHFcXzEsIHFcXnt9Myl9XHRvIDAuXHRpbWVzIDEwXnstNTF9XHJpZ2h0XH0=\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2141em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">{</span></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">max Baxter residual (q_1, q</span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.25em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˆ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">3)</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8641em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">51</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">}</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div></div></div>",
