le=\"left:-0.25em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˆ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">(-u/h)</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.75em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:6em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-2.75em;\"></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:3.25em;\"><span style=\"top:-5.41em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">normalised by</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.21em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Res at th2</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.01em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Res at th2+h</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-1.81em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Res at th2</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-0.61em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Res at th2+h</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.75em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:6em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-2.75em;\"></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:3.25em;\"><span style=\"top:-5.41em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">max |bracket - &lt;Omega|(1 - k R</span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.25em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˆ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">S)|Psi&gt;|</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.21em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">49.9</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.01em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">222</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-1.81em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">49.9</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-0.61em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0.</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">49</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.75em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:6em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-2.75em;\"></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.5em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:5.25em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.7em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:5.25em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.9em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:5.25em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-6.1em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:5.25em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-7.3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:5.25em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-8.5em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:5.25em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.75em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div></div></div>",
       "mime": "x-application/wolfram-language-html"
      },
      {
       "data": "Out[586]= \\begin{array}{|c|c|c|}\\hline\\text{exponential} & \\text{normalised by} & \\text{max |bracket - <Omega|(1 - k R\\^{}S)|Psi>|}\\\\\\hline\\text{k\\^{}(+u/h)} & \\text{Res at th2} & 49.9\\\\\\hline\\text{k\\^{}(+u/h)} & \\text{Res at th2+h} & 222\\\\\\hline\\text{k\\^{}(-u/h)} & \\text{Res at th2} & 49.9\\\\\\hline\\text{k\\^{}(-u/h)} & \\text{Res at th2+h} & 0.\\times 10^{-49}\\\\\\hline\\end{array}",
       "mime": "text/plain"
      }
     ],
     "id": "f3ea2a92-59d7-4597-97d5-b0f49bc12822"
    }
   ],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "### Finding: site-2 bracket\n\n$$\\frac{\\oint \\frac{Q^3(u)\\,k^{-u/h}\\,du}{(u-\\theta_2)(u-\\theta_2-h)}}{\\mathrm{Res}_{u=\\theta_2+h}} = 1-k\\,\\frac{Q^3(\\theta_2)}{Q^3(\\theta_2+h)} = \\langle\\Omega|\\,(1-kR^S(\\theta_2+2h))\\,|\\Psi_A\\rangle,\\qquad \\langle\\Omega|\\Psi_A\\rangle=1,$$\nall 64 states, residual $\\sim10^{-49}$ ($k=3/7$). The other three choices ($k^{+u/h}$, and/or normalising at $\\theta_2$) fail at $O(10^2)$. $k^{-u/h}$ matches the $z_3^{-u/h}$ of $Q^3$; normalising at $\\theta_2+\\lambda_2h$ matches the site-1 convention $f(\\theta_1+\\lambda_2h)$.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "# Eigenvalue of $t^S_{\\{1,1\\}}(\\theta_2+2h)$ in terms of $Q^{23}$\n\n$t^S_{\\{1,1\\}}(u)=t_2(u+h)/(\\nu_3(u)\\nu_3(u+h))$, so the eigenvalue at $u=\\theta_2+2h$ is $\\tau_2(\\theta_2+3h)/(\\nu_3(\\theta_2+2h)\\nu_3(\\theta_2+3h))$. Test it against $C\\,Q^{23}(\\theta_2+ah)/Q^{23}(\\theta_2+bh)$ with $Q^{23}(u)=Q^2(u)Q^3(u+h)-Q^3(u)Q^2(u+h)$ (full twisted $Q^j=z_j^{-u/h}q^j$).",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "qDual2 = Table[solveMonic[baxDual[tauPoly[[A]], 1/N[zs[[2]], prec]], muOf[[A, 2]]], {A, 64}];\nQup[A_, j_, x_] := N[zs[[j]], prec]^(-x/hh) If[j == 2, qDual2, qDual3][[A, 1]][x];\nQ23[A_, x_] := Qup[A, 2, x] Qup[A, 3, x + hh] - Qup[A, 3, x] Qup[A, 2, x + hh];\nrho11 = Table[With[{x = th[2] + 2 hh}, (tauPoly[[A, 2]] /. u -> x + hh)/(nu[3][x] nu[3][x + hh])], {A, 64}];\n(* Q^23 has a state-independent zero at th2 + n h for some n: skip those shifts *)\nzeroShifts = Select[Range[-3, 4], Max[Abs[Table[Q23[A, th[2] + # hh], {A, 64}]]] < 10^-30 &];\nscanF[rho_, qf_, th0_] := Flatten[Table[If[MemberQ[zeroShifts, a] || MemberQ[zeroShifts, b], Nothing,\n     With[{cs = Table[rho[[A]] qf[A, th0 + b hh]/qf[A, th0 + a hh], {A, 64}]}, {a, b, N[Max[Abs[cs - Mean[cs]]]/Abs[Mean[cs]], 3], N[Mean[cs], 12]}]], {a, -3, 4}, {b, -3, 4}], 1];\nGrid[Join[{{\"max Baxter residual q^2\", N[Max[qDual2[[All, 2]]], 3]}, {\"zeros of Q^23 at th2 + n h, n =\", zeroShifts}, {\"a\", \"b\", \"rel. spread of C\", \"C\"}}, best[scanF[rho11, Q23, th[2]]]], Frame -> All]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
