  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "### Finding: $t^S_{\\{1,1\\}}$ eigenvalue (all 64 states, spread $\\sim10^{-49}$; confirmed at point 2)\n\n$$\\mathrm{eig}_A\\,t^S_{\\{1,1\\}}(\\theta_2+2h) = \\frac{Q^{23}_A(\\theta_2+h)}{Q^{23}_A(\\theta_2+2h)},\\qquad Q^{23}(u)=Q^2(u)Q^3(u+h)-Q^3(u)Q^2(u+h),$$\nwith no extra constant (full twisted $Q^j=z_j^{-u/h}q^j$, $\\nu_3$-normalised $t^S_{\\{1,1\\}}$). The scan output is $(a,b)=(1,2)$ with $C=\\rho\\,Q(\\theta_2+bh)/Q(\\theta_2+ah)=1$. $Q^{23}$ has a state-independent zero at $u=\\theta_2$.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## Site-2 bracket for $1-k\\,t^S_{\\{1,1\\}}$, and what it does on site 2\n\n$\\oint \\frac{Q^{23}(u)\\,k^{\\pm u/h}}{(u-\\theta_2-h)(u-\\theta_2-2h)}$, normalised by the residue at either pole, vs $\\langle\\Omega|(1-k\\,t^S_{\\{1,1\\}}(\\theta_2+2h))|\\Psi_A\\rangle$ with $\\langle\\Omega|\\Psi_A\\rangle=1$. Then: is $\\langle\\Omega|t^S_{\\{1,1\\}}(\\theta_2+2h) \\propto \\langle\\Omega_1|\\otimes\\langle\\Omega_2|\\,t^{S,(2)}_{\\{1,1\\}}(\\theta_2+2h)$ with the **single-site** site-2 transfer matrix (monodromy $L_2(u-\\theta_2)G$)?",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "tS11n = With[{x = th[2] + 2 hh}, towers[Gd, \"tS\", x][\"t11\"]/(nu[3][x] nu[3][x + hh])];\nopSide11 = Table[With[{psi = evecs[[A]]/(Om . evecs[[A]])}, Om . (psi - kT N[tS11n, prec] . psi)], {A, 64}];\nres11[A_, s_, n_] := Q23[A, th[2] + n hh] kT^(s (th[2] + n hh)/hh)/(If[n == 1, -hh, hh]);\nbr11[A_, s_, nm_] := (res11[A, s, 1] + res11[A, s, 2])/res11[A, s, nm];\nGrid[Prepend[Flatten[Table[{If[s == 1, \"k^(+u/h)\", \"k^(-u/h)\"], \"Res at th2+\" <> ToString[nm] <> \"h\", N[Max[Abs[Table[br11[A, s, nm], {A, 64}] - opSide11]], 3]}, {s, {1, -1}}, {nm, {1, 2}}], 1], {\"exponential\", \"normalised by\", \"max |bracket - <Omega|(1 - k tS11)|Psi>|\"}], Frame -> All]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"677717\" data-output-id=\"59\" data-out-n=\"604\" data-sub-idx=\"4\" data-output-format=\"WLLatex\" data-output-is-graphics=\"0\" data-cell-idx=\"50\" data-sub-start=\"4\" data-sub-end=\"4\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[604]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered\" data-page-width-em=\"21\" data-latex-b64=\"\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:6.04em;vertical-align:-2.75em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:3.29em;\"><span style=\"top:-5.25em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:5.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:6em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-2.75em;\"></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:3.25em;\"><span style=\"top:-5.41em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">exponential</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.21em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">k</span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"heigh