  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* normalised statement: <Omega| tS11n = c12 <Omega1| (x) <Omega2| tS11^(2), single-site nu3^(2)(x) = x - th2, c12 = (th21 + h)/(th21 + 2h) *)\nth21 = th[2] - th[1];\ntS11single = t2single[th[2] + 3 hh]/((th[2] + 2 hh - th[2]) (th[2] + 3 hh - th[2]));\nc12 = (th21 + hh)/(th21 + 2 hh);\nkron[f1, f2] . tS11n == c12 kron[f1, f2 . tS11single]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"677717\" data-output-id=\"61\" data-out-n=\"616\" data-sub-idx=\"4\" data-output-format=\"WLLatex\" data-output-is-graphics=\"0\" data-cell-idx=\"52\" data-sub-start=\"4\" data-sub-end=\"4\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[616]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered\" data-page-width-em=\"21\" data-latex-b64=\"XG1hdGhybXtUcnVlfQ==\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">True</span></span></span></span></span></span></div></div></div>",
