  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "### Findings: $1-k\\,t^S_{\\{1,1\\}}$\n\n- **Bracket** (all 64 states, residual $\\sim10^{-48}$; other three choices fail at $O(10^{1\\text{-}2})$):\n$$\\frac{1}{\\mathrm{Res}_{u=\\theta_2+2h}}\\oint\\frac{Q^{23}(u)\\,k^{-u/h}\\,du}{(u-\\theta_2-h)(u-\\theta_2-2h)} = 1-k\\,\\frac{Q^{23}(\\theta_2+h)}{Q^{23}(\\theta_2+2h)} = \\langle\\Omega|(1-k\\,t^S_{\\{1,1\\}}(\\theta_2+2h))|\\Psi_A\\rangle.$$\n- **Operator** (exact, points 1 and 2): $\\langle\\Omega|\\,t^S_{\\{1,1\\}}(\\theta_2+2h) = c_{12}\\,\\langle\\Omega_1|\\otimes\\langle\\Omega_2|\\,t^{S,(2)}_{\\{1,1\\}}(\\theta_2+2h)$, the **single-site** site-2 transfer matrix ($\\nu^{(2)}_3(x)=x-\\theta_2$ normalisation), with $c_{12}=\\dfrac{\\theta_{21}+h}{\\theta_{21}+2h}$, $\\theta_{21}=\\theta_2-\\theta_1$ — mirror of $c_1=\\frac{\\theta_{12}-2h}{\\theta_{12}-h}$ for $t^{(1)}_{\\{1,1\\}}(\\theta_1)$ in `L2-mathcalA.tex`. A linear operator on site 2, not a rotation.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "# Hodge duality: $Q^3\\leftrightarrow Q_{12}$, $Q^{23}\\leftrightarrow Q_1$\n\nLower Q's $Q_i=z_i^{u/h}q_i$ from the direct Baxter operator, $Q_{12}(u)=Q_1(u)Q_2(u-h)-Q_2(u)Q_1(u-h)$. Fit $Q_{12}(u)=G(u)\\,Q^3(u+sh)$ and $Q^{23}(u)=G'(u)\\,Q_1(u+s'h)$ with $G,G'$ state-independent: for each shift, the ratio must be the same for all 64 states at every $u$. Then strip the exponential $(z_1z_2z_3)^{\\pm u/h}$ and read off the polynomial part by interpolation.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "qDir2 = Table[solveMonic[baxDir[tauPoly[[A]], N[zs[[2]], prec]], 2 lam1 - muOf[[A, 2]]], {A, 64}];\nQlow[A_, i_, x_] := N[zs[[i]], prec]^(x/hh) If[i == 1, qDir, qDir2][[A, 1]][x];\nQ12[A_, x_] := Qlow[A, 1, x] Qlow[A, 2, x - hh] - Qlow[A, 2, x] Qlow[A, 1, x - hh];\nuTs = {1/17, 3/11, -2/13, 5/7, 8/19, -9/23, 12/29, 2/31, -4/37, 7/41};\n(* state-spread of the ratio f/g(u + s h) at generic u, per shift *)\ndualScan[f_, g_] := Table[{s, N[Max[Table[With[{r = Table[f[A, x]/g[A, x + s hh], {A, 64}]}, Max[Abs[r - Mean[r]]]/Abs[Mean[r]]], {x, uTs}]], 3]}, {s, -3, 3}];\n{\"Baxter residual q_2\" -> N[Max[qDir2[[All, 2]]], 3], \"Q12 / Q^3(u+sh)\" -> dualScan[Q12, Q3], \"Q^23 / Q_1(u+sh)\" -> dualScan[Q23, Qlow[#1, 1, #2] &]}",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"677717\" data-output-id=\"62\" data-out-n=\"622\" data-sub-idx=\"6\" data-output-format=\"WLLatex\" data-output-is-graphics=\"0\" data-cell-idx=\"55\" data-sub-start=\"6\" data-sub-end=\"6\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[622]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered\" data-page-width-em=\"21\" data-line-broken=\"1\" data-latex-b64=\"\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:21.9242em;vertical-align:-10.7121em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"col-align-r\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:11.2121em;\"><span style=\"top:-16.798em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:6.45em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-15.298em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:6.45em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-10.188em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:6.45em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-5.098em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:6.45em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span><span style=\"top:0.012em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:6.45em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:10.7121em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"col-align-l\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:11.2121em;\"><span style=\"top:-16.798em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:6.45em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span cla