      {
       "data": "Out[622]= \\begin{aligned}\n  &\\left\\{\\text{Baxter residual q\\_2}\\to 0.\\times 10^{-53} \\right. \\\\\n  &\\left. ,\\text{Q12 / Q\\^{}3(u+sh)} \\right. \\\\\n  &\\left. \\to \\begin{pmatrix}-3 & 468\\\\-2 & 197\\\\-1 & 131\\\\0 & 0.\\times 10^{-49}\\\\1 & 67.0\\\\2 & 76.8\\\\3 & 60.5\\end{pmatrix} \\right. \\\\\n  &\\left. ,\\text{Q\\^{}23 / Q\\_1(u+sh)} \\right. \\\\\n  &\\left. \\to \\begin{pmatrix}-3 & 421\\\\-2 & 1380\\\\-1 & 318\\\\0 & 0.\\times 10^{-48}\\\\1 & 384\\\\2 & 198\\\\3 & 57.4\\end{pmatrix}\\right\\}\n\\end{aligned}",
