  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* site-2 brackets rewritten through the lower Q's; K = k z1 z2 z3 absorbs the determinant twist *)\nKT = kT zprod;\nresQ12[A_, x_] := Q12[A, x] KT^(-x/hh)/nu[1][x];\nbrQ12[A_] := With[{r0 = resQ12[A, th[2]]/((th[2] - th[2] - hh)), r1 = resQ12[A, th[2] + hh]/(hh)}, (r0 + r1)/r1];\nresQ1[A_, x_] := Qlow[A, 1, x] nu[3][x] KT^(-x/hh);\nbrQ1[A_] := With[{r1 = resQ1[A, th[2] + hh]/(-hh), r2 = resQ1[A, th[2] + 2 hh]/(hh)}, (r1 + r2)/r2];\nGrid[{{\"Q12 form of the R^S bracket: max |. - <Omega|(1 - k R^S)|Psi>|\", N[Max[Abs[Table[brQ12[A], {A, 64}] - opSide]], 3]},\n  {\"Q1 form of the tS11 bracket: max |. - <Omega|(1 - k tS11)|Psi>|\", N[Max[Abs[Table[brQ1[A], {A, 64}] - opSide11]], 3]}}, Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
