  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "### Findings: brackets in terms of lower Q's (point 1, residual $\\sim10^{-49}$)\n\nHodge duality, no shift, state-independent factors:\n$$Q_{12}(u)=\\Big(\\tfrac1{z_2}-\\tfrac1{z_1}\\Big)\\nu_1(u)\\,(z_1z_2z_3)^{u/h}\\,Q^3(u),\\qquad Q^{23}(u)=\\Big(\\tfrac1{z_3}-\\tfrac1{z_2}\\Big)\\nu_3(u)\\,(z_1z_2z_3)^{-u/h}\\,Q_1(u).$$\nWith $K=k\\,z_1z_2z_3$:\n$$\\langle\\Omega|(1-kR^S)|\\Psi\\rangle=\\frac{\\oint_{\\theta_2,\\theta_2+h}\\frac{Q_{12}(u)\\,K^{-u/h}}{\\nu_1(u)(u-\\theta_2)(u-\\theta_2-h)}}{\\mathrm{Res}_{\\theta_2+h}},\\qquad\n\\langle\\Omega|(1-k\\,t^S_{\\{1,1\\}})|\\Psi\\rangle=\\frac{\\oint_{\\theta_2+h,\\theta_2+2h}\\frac{Q_1(u)\\,\\nu_3(u)\\,K^{-u/h}}{(u-\\theta_2-h)(u-\\theta_2-2h)}}{\\mathrm{Res}_{\\theta_2+2h}}.$$\n($\\nu_1$ vanishes at $\\theta_2+2h$ but so does $Q_{12}$, so no extra pole there.)",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "# Second point\n\nEverything above re-derived at a new point $(h,\\theta_1,\\theta_2,z)$, same vacuum parameters $p_1=1$, $p_2=8/5$ (rotparams $p_3$ recomputed for the new $z$).",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "hh = 1/2; th[1] = 3/13; th[2] = -4/17; zs = {3, -7/2, 11/4}; Gd = DiagonalMatrix[zs];\nClearAll[T, TGp, QMGp, tGp];\nT[{i_, j_}][u_] := T[{i, j}][u] = Sum[KroneckerProduct[\\[ScriptCapitalL][1][i, k][u - th[1]], \\[ScriptCapitalL][2][k, j][u - th[2]]], {k, 3}];\nTGp[Gm_][{i_, j_}][u_] := TGp[Gm][{i, j}][u] = Sum[T[{i, k}][u] Gm[[k, j]], {k, 3}];\nQMGp[Gm_][Ii_, Jj_][u_] := QMGp[Gm][Ii, Jj][u] = Sum[Signature[Permutations[Ii][[\\[Sigma]]]] (Dot @@ (TGp[Gm][#][u + hh - hh Last[Flatten[Position[Transpose[{Permutations[Ii][[\\[Sigma]]], Jj}], #]]]] & /@ Transpose[{Permutations[Ii][[\\[Sigma]]], Jj}])), {\\[Sigma], 1, Length[Permutations[Ii]]}];\ntGp[Gm_][a_][u_] := tGp[Gm][a][u] = Sum[QMGp[Gm][Ii, Ii][u], {Ii, Subsets[Range[3], {a}]}];\nrotparamsN = {p3 -> (p2 (-z[1] + z[3]))/(p1 (z[2] - z[3]))} /. z[a_] :> zs[[a]];\n{f1, f2} = {rpVac[1], rpVac[2]} /. {p1 -> 1, p2 -> 8/5};\ni1 = First@FirstPosition[f1, _?(# != 0 &)]; Om = N[kron[f1, f2], prec];\nRn1 = With[{o = towers[Gd, \"t\", th[1]]}, o[\"t20\"] . Inverse[o[\"t10\"]]/nu[1][th[1] + hh]];\nRn2 = With[{o = towers[Gd, \"tS\", th[2] + 2 hh]}, o[\"t20\"] . Inverse[o[\"t10\"]]/nu[3][th[2] + 2 hh - hh]];\ntS11n = With[{x = th[2] + 2 hh}, towers[Gd, \"tS\", x][\"t11\"]/(nu[3][x] nu[3][x + hh])];\n(* localization (exact) *)\nlocP2 = {locG[Gd, 1, \"t\", th[1], f1, f2], locG[Gd, 2, \"tS\", th[2] + 2 hh, f1, f2]};\n(* c12 identity (exact) *)\nth21 = th[2] - th[1]; c12 = (th21 + hh)/(th21 + 2 hh);\nc12ok = kron[f1, f2] . tS11n == c12 kron[f1, f2 . (t2single[th[2] + 3 hh]/((2 hh) (3 hh)))];\n(* spectrum, tau polynomials, weights, Q's *)\nMmix = N[tGp[Gd][1][1/13] + 3 tGp[Gd][2][-2/9], prec]; {evals, evecs} = Eigensystem[Mmix];\nkk = First@Ordering[Abs[#], -1] & /@ evecs;\ntauPts = Table[tauEig[a, x], {a, 3}, {x, upts}];\ntauPoly = Table[Expand@InterpolatingPolynomial[Transpose[{upts, tauPts[[a, All, A]]}], u], {A, 64}, {a, 3}];\nmuOf = Table[Round@Re[Table[(N[EE[i, i], prec] . evecs[[A]])[[kk[[A]]]]/evecs[[A, kk[[A]]]], {i, 3}]], {A, 64}];\nqDir = Table[solveMonic[baxDir[tauPoly[[A]], N[zs[[1]], prec]], 2 lam1 - muOf[[A, 1]]], {A, 64}];\nqDir2 = Table[solveMonic[baxDir[tauPoly[[A]], N[zs[[2]], prec]], 2 lam1 - muOf[[A, 2]]], {A, 64}];\nqDual2 = Table[solveMonic[baxDual[tauPoly[[A]], 1/N[zs[[2]], prec]], muOf[[A, 2]]], {A, 64}];\nqDual3 = Table[solveMonic[baxDual[tauPoly[[A]], 1/N[zs[[3]], prec]], muOf[[A, 3]]], {A, 64}];\nzprod = N[Times @@ zs, prec]; KT = kT zprod;\nrho1 = Table[With[{x = th[1]}, ((tauPoly[[A, 1]] /. u -> x) (tauPoly[[A, 1]] /. u -> x + hh) - (tauPoly[[A, 2]] /. u -> x + hh))/(tauPoly[[A, 1]] /. u -> x)/nu[1][x + hh]], {A, 64}];\nrhoS = Table[With[{x = th[2] + 2 hh}, ((tauPoly[[A, 1]] /. u -> x - hh) (tauPoly[[A, 1]] /. u -> x) - (tauPoly[[A, 2]] /. u -> x))/(tauPoly[[A, 1]] /. u -> x)/nu[3][x - hh]], {A, 64}];\nrho11 = Table[With[{x = th[2] + 2 hh}, (tauPoly[[A, 2]] /. u -> x + hh)/(nu[3][x] nu[3][x + hh])], {A, 64}];\nopSide = Table[With[{psi = evecs[[A]]/(Om . evecs[[A]])}, Om . (psi - kT N[Rn2, prec] . psi)], {A, 64}];\nopSide11 = Table[With[{psi = evecs[[A]]/(Om . evecs[[A]])}, Om . (psi - kT N[tS11n, prec] . psi)], {A, 64}];\nrelErr[l1_, l2_] := N[Max[Abs[l1 - l2]]/Max[Abs[l2]], 3];\nGrid[{{\"check (point 2)\", \"result\"},\n  {\"Baxter residual (q1, q2, q^2, q^3)\", N[Max[Join[qDir[[All, 2]], qDir2[[All, 2]], qDual2[[All, 2]], qDual3[[All, 2]]]], 3]},\n  {\"localized: site 1 (t at th1), site 2 (tS at th2+2h)\", locP2[[All, 2]]},\n  {\"<Omega| tS11 = c12 <Omega1| (x) <Omega2| tS11^(2)\", c12ok},\n  {\"eig R(th1) = Q1(th1+2h)/Q1(th1+h)\", relErr[rho1, Table[Qlow[A, 1, th[1] + 2 hh]/Qlow[A, 1, th[1] + hh], {A, 64}]]},\n  {\"eig R^S(th2+2h) = Q^3(th2)/Q^3(th2+h)\", relErr[rhoS, Table[Q3[A, th[2]]/Q3[A, th[2] + hh], {A, 64}]]},\n  {\"eig tS11(th2+2h) = Q^23(th2+h)/Q^23(th2+2h)\", relErr[rho11, Table[Q23[A, th[2] + hh]/Q23[A, th[2] + 2 hh], {A, 64}]]},\n  {\"Q^3 bracket (k^(-u/h), Res at th2+h) vs <Omega|(1-kR^S)|Psi>\", relErr[Table[br[A, -1, 1], {A, 64}], opSide]},\n  {\"Q^23 bracket (k^(-u/h), Res at th2+2h) vs <Omega|(1-k tS11)|Psi>\", relErr[Table[br11[A, -1, 2], {A, 64}], opSide11]},\n  {\"Q12 form vs <Omega|(1-kR^S)|Psi>\", relErr[Table[brQ12[A], {A, 64}], opSide]},\n  {\"Q1 form vs <Omega|(1-k tS11)|Psi>\", relErr[Table[brQ1[A], {A, 64}], opSide11]}}, Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"677717\" data-output-id=\"66\" data-out-n=\"698\" data-sub-idx=\"34\" data-output-format=\"WLLatex\" data-output-is-graphics=\"0\" data-cell-idx=\"60\" data-sub-start=\"34\" data-sub-end=\"44\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[698]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered\" data-page-width-em=\"21\" data-latex-b64=\"\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:14.44em;vertical-align:-6.95em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:7.49em;\"><span style=\"top:-9.45em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:9.45em;\"></span><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:14.4em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-6.95em;\"></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:7.45em;\"><span style=\"top:-10.06em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.45em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">check (point 2)</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-8.86em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.45em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Baxter residual (q1, q2, q</span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.25em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˆ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">2, q</span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.25em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˆ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">3)</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-7.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.45em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">localized: site 1 (t at th1), site 2 (tS at th2+2h)</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-5.26em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.45em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">&lt;Omega| tS11 = c12 &lt;Omega1| (x) &lt;Omega2| tS11</span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.25em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˆ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">(2)</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.06em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.45em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">eig R(th1) = Q1(th1+2h)/Q1(th1+h)</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.86em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.45em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">eig R</span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.25em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˆ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">S(th2+2h) = Q</span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.25em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˆ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">3(th2)/Q</span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.25em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˆ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">3(th2+h)</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-1.66em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.45em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">eig tS11(th2+2h) = Q</span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.25em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˆ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">23(th2+h)/Q</span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.25em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˆ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">23(th2+2h)</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-0.46em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.45em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Q</span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.25em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˆ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">3 bracket (k</span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.25em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˆ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">(-u/h), Res at th2+h) vs &lt;Omega|(1-kR</span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.25em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˆ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">S)|Psi&gt;</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:0.74em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.45em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Q</span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.25em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˆ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">23 bracket (k</span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.25em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˆ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">(-u/h), Res at th2+2h) vs &lt;Omega|(1-k tS11)|Psi&gt;</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:1.94em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.45em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Q12 form vs &lt;Omega|(1-kR</span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.25em;\">