  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "### Point 2 ($h=1/2$, $\\theta=(3/13,-4/17)$, $z=(3,-7/2,11/4)$): everything confirmed\n\nBaxter residual $\\sim10^{-47}$; localization of $\\{1,R,t_{11},Rt_{11}\\}$ on each site exact; $c_{12}=\\frac{\\theta_{21}+h}{\\theta_{21}+2h}$ identity exact; all three eigenvalue formulas, both upper-Q brackets and both lower-Q ($Q_{12}$, $Q_1$) forms agree to $\\sim10^{-47}$ relative. (An earlier version of this notebook stated the $t^S_{\\{1,1\\}}$ eigenvalue upside down; corrected above.)",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "# The site-2 product functional, moved to site 1 on highest-weight states\n\n$\\langle k_1^{-u/h}Q^3\\rangle\\langle k_2^{-u/h}Q^{23}\\rangle \\leftrightarrow \\langle\\Omega|(1-k_1R^S)(1-k_2t^S_{\\{1,1\\}})$ at $\\theta_2+2h$ $=\\langle\\Omega_1|\\otimes\\langle w(k_1,k_2)|$. With $\\langle\\Omega_n|=e_1^Tg_0$: $(\\cdot)(g_0^{-1}\\otimes g_0^{-1}) = e_1^T\\otimes\\langle x|$. Write $\\langle x|=e_1^TN$, $N\\in U(\\mathfrak n_+)$; on a highest-weight state of $V\\otimes V$, $E^{(2)}_{ij}\\to-E^{(1)}_{ij}$ for raising $E_{ij}$, so $(e_1^T\\otimes e_1^TN)|h\\rangle=(e_1^TS(N)\\otimes e_1^T)|h\\rangle$ with the antipode $S$ (reverse order, $-1$ per generator). Current point: point 2.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* product covector, exact in k1, k2 *)\nOpk = (IdentityMatrix[d1 d2] - k1 Rn2) . (IdentityMatrix[d1 d2] - k2 tS11n);\nvk = kron[f1, f2] . Opk;\nmk = ArrayReshape[vk, {d1, d2}];\nwk = Together[mk[[i1]]/f1[[i1]]];\nlocK = {Table[MatrixRank[mk /. {k1 -> a, k2 -> b}], {a, {1/3, -2}}, {b, {2/7, 5}}], Simplify[mk - Outer[Times, f1, wk]] === ConstantArray[0, {d1, d2}]};\n(* undo the reference rotation g0 on both sites *)\np3v = p3 /. rotparamsN /. {p1 -> 1, p2 -> 8/5};\ng0[\\[Alpha]_] := MatrixExp[1 Ee[\\[Alpha]][1, 2]] . MatrixExp[8/5 Ee[\\[Alpha]][1, 3]] . MatrixExp[p3v Ee[\\[Alpha]][2, 3]];\nxk = Together[wk . Inverse[g0[2]]];\n{\"rank of <Omega|Op(k1,k2) (4 k-points), exact product\" -> locK, \"f_n == e1.g0\" -> {f1 == ext[1, True] . g0[1], f2 == ext[2, True] . g0[2]}}",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
