  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* y in the same PBW monomials, now on site 1: y = e1^T sum d_m E12^a E13^b E23^c *)\nrowsM1 = ext[1, True] . (mpow[Ee[1][1, 2], #[[1]]] . mpow[Ee[1][1, 3], #[[2]]] . mpow[Ee[1][2, 3], #[[3]]]) & /@ mono[[basisIdx]];\ncoefY = Together[LinearSolve[Transpose[rowsM1], yk]];\nwtsV = Transpose[Table[Diagonal[Ee[1][i, i]], {i, 3}]];\nGrid[Join[{{\"GT basis weight\", \"x (site 2, after g0^-1)\", \"y = <new vec| (site 1)\"}}, Transpose[{wtsV, Factor /@ xk, Factor /@ yk}],\n   {{\"PBW monomial E12^a E13^b E23^c\", \"N (x = e1^T N)\", \"y = e1^T (...)\"}}, Transpose[{mono[[basisIdx]], Factor /@ coefN, Factor /@ coefY}]], Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
