  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* which highest-weight states of V (x) V does <y| (x) e1^T reach? weight of each h from the global Cartan *)\nhwWt[h_] := Table[First@Select[(EE[i, i] . h)/h, NumericQ[#] &], {i, 3}] /. Indeterminate -> Nothing;\nhwWt[h_] := Module[{j = First@FirstPosition[h, _?(# != 0 &)]}, Table[(EE[i, i] . h)[[j]]/h[[j]], {i, 3}]];\nGrid[Prepend[Table[{hwWt[h], Factor[kron[yk, ext[2, True]] . h]}, {h, hws}], {\"highest weight of irrep in V (x) V\", \"<y| (x) e1^T . h\"}], Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
