  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "### Findings: site-2 functional moved to site 1 (point 2, exact in $k_1,k_2$)\n\n- $\\langle\\Omega|(1-k_1R^S)(1-k_2t^S_{\\{1,1\\}}) = \\langle\\Omega_1|\\otimes\\langle w|$ exactly; after $g_0^{-1}\\otimes g_0^{-1}$: $e_1^T\\otimes\\langle x|$, $\\langle x|=e_1^TN$.\n- On all 6 highest-weight states of $V\\otimes V$: $(e_1^T\\otimes\\langle x|)|h\\rangle=(\\langle y|\\otimes e_1^T)|h\\rangle$, $\\langle y|=e_1^TS(N)$ (antipode), checked exactly.\n- $k_2=0$: $\\langle x| = (1-k_1z_3)\\,e_1^Te^{(p_3'-p_3)E_{23}}$, $\\langle y|=(1-k_1z_3)\\,e_1^Te^{-(p_3'-p_3)E_{23}}$, $p_3'-p_3=p_3\\frac{k_1(z_3-z_2)}{1-k_1z_3}$. So $k_1$ moves along $E_{23}$ (site-1 family: $E_{12}$).\n- $\\langle y|$ has weights $(2,1,0),(2,0,1),(1,2,0),(1,1,1)^2,(1,0,2)$; zero in $(0,2,1),(0,1,2)$.\n- Reached highest-weight states: $27\\ (4,2,0)$, $\\overline{10}$/$10$ $(4,1,1)$ via $k_1$ alone, $(3,3,0)$ via $k_2$, both octets $(3,2,1)$ with direction $(2,\\,11k_1-2)$ ($k_1$ resolves the multiplicity). **Singlet $(2,2,2)$: exactly 0** — missed, as for the site-1 family.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "# Singlet: site-1 and site-2 localized operators together\n\nEach family alone misses the singlet. Test the products $\\langle\\Omega|\\,O_1(\\theta_1)\\,O_2(\\theta_2+2h)$ with $O_1\\in\\{1,R,t_{11},Rt_{11}\\}$ (site 1), $O_2\\in\\{1,R^S,t^S_{11},R^St^S_{11}\\}$ (site 2) — as functionals these are products of a site-1 and a site-2 bracket. The singlet $|s\\rangle$ is global-$GL(3)$ covariant, so $\\langle\\Omega|O|s\\rangle\\neq0$ iff the covector has a singlet component (with or without undoing $g_0$).",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "sing = First@Select[hws, hwWt[#] == {2, 2, 2} &];\nops1 = With[{o = towers[Gd, \"t\", th[1]]}, <|\"1\" -> IdentityMatrix[d1 d2], \"R\" -> o[\"t20\"] . Inverse[o[\"t10\"]], \"t11\" -> o[\"t11\"], \"R.t11\" -> o[\"t20\"] . Inverse[o[\"t10\"]] . o[\"t11\"]|>];\nops2 = With[{o = towers[Gd, \"tS\", th[2] + 2 hh]}, <|\"1\" -> IdentityMatrix[d1 d2], \"R^S\" -> o[\"t20\"] . Inverse[o[\"t10\"]], \"tS11\" -> o[\"t11\"], \"R^S.tS11\" -> o[\"t20\"] . Inverse[o[\"t10\"]] . o[\"t11\"]|>];\nOmX = kron[f1, f2];\nsingTab = Table[OmX . ops1[a] . ops2[b] . sing, {a, Keys[ops1]}, {b, Keys[ops2]}];\nGrid[Prepend[MapThread[Prepend, {singTab, Keys[ops1]}], Prepend[Keys[ops2], \"O1 \\\\ O2\"]], Frame -> All]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
