  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "### Finding: the singlet IS reached by site-1 × site-2 products (point 2, exact)\n\n$\\langle\\Omega|O_1O_2|s\\rangle$: row/column \"1\" (one site only) all exactly 0, consistent with the single-family results. Nonzero: $R\\cdot R^St^S_{11}$, $t_{11}\\cdot t^S_{11}$, $Rt_{11}\\cdot R^S$, $Rt_{11}\\cdot R^St^S_{11}$. Zero: $R\\cdot R^S$, $R\\cdot t^S_{11}$, $t_{11}\\cdot R^S$, $t_{11}\\cdot R^St^S_{11}$, $Rt_{11}\\cdot t^S_{11}$.\n\nAs functionals ($\\langle\\Omega|\\Psi\\rangle=1$): $\\langle k_1Q_1\\rangle\\langle k_2Q_{12}\\rangle\\langle k_3^{-u/h}Q^3\\rangle\\langle k_4^{-u/h}Q^{23}\\rangle$ has a singlet component, first at order $k_2k_4$ ($t_{11}\\otimes t^S_{11}$), then $k_1k_3k_4$, $k_1k_2k_3$, $k_1k_2k_3k_4$. The product covector need not be a product state; it is the functional product that matters.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "# Which irreps of $V\\otimes V$ does the four-parameter family reach?\n\n$\\langle\\Omega|(1-k_1R)(1-k_2t_{11})(1-k_3R^S)(1-k_4t^S_{11})\\,(g_0^{-1}\\otimes g_0^{-1})$, with $R,t_{11}$ at $\\theta_1$ and $R^S,t^S_{11}$ at $\\theta_2+2h$. For each highest weight, the number of reached highest-weight vectors = rank of the pairings with that weight's highest-weight vectors over all $k$-monomials (finite twist). Full reach: $27,10,\\overline{10},1$ once each, the octet twice. Both points; subfamilies for comparison.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "setPoint[{h_, t1_, t2_, z_}] := (\n   hh = h; th[1] = t1; th[2] = t2; zs = z; Gd = DiagonalMatrix[z];\n   ClearAll[T, TGp, QMGp, tGp];\n   T[{i_, j_}][u_] := T[{i, j}][u] = Sum[KroneckerProduct[\\[ScriptCapitalL][1][i, k][u - th[1]], \\[ScriptCapitalL][2][k, j][u - th[2]]], {k, 3}];\n   TGp[Gm_][{i_, j_}][u_] := TGp[Gm][{i, j}][u] = Sum[T[{i, k}][u] Gm[[k, j]], {k, 3}];\n   QMGp[Gm_][Ii_, Jj_][u_] := QMGp[Gm][Ii, Jj][u] = Sum[Signature[Permutations[Ii][[\\[Sigma]]]] (Dot @@ (TGp[Gm][#][u + hh - hh Last[Flatten[Position[Transpose[{Permutations[Ii][[\\[Sigma]]], Jj}], #]]]] & /@ Transpose[{Permutations[Ii][[\\[Sigma]]], Jj}])), {\\[Sigma], 1, Length[Permutations[Ii]]}];\n   tGp[Gm_][a_][u_] := tGp[Gm][a][u] = Sum[QMGp[Gm][Ii, Ii][u], {Ii, Subsets[Range[3], {a}]}];\n   rotparamsN = {p3 -> (p2 (-z[1] + z[3]))/(p1 (z[2] - z[3]))} /. z[a_] :> zs[[a]];\n   {f1, f2} = {rpVac[1], rpVac[2]} /. {p1 -> 1, p2 -> 8/5};\n   p3v = p3 /. rotparamsN /. {p1 -> 1, p2 -> 8/5};);\npts4 = {{1/3, 2/7, -5/11, {2, -3, 5}}, {1/2, 3/13, -4/17, {3, -7/2, 11/4}}};\nhwGroups = GatherBy[hws, hwWt];\nreach[] := Module[{o1 = towers[Gd, \"t\", th[1]], o2 = towers[Gd, \"tS\", th[2] + 2 hh], ops, G0i, vecs},\n   ops = {o1[\"t20\"] . Inverse[o1[\"t10\"]], o1[\"t11\"], o2[\"t20\"] . Inverse[o2[\"t10\"]], o2[\"t11\"]};\n   G0i = KroneckerProduct[Inverse[g0[1]], Inverse[g0[2]]];\n   (* covector of each k-monomial k_S = prod_{i in S} k_i (ops commute; order kept anyway) *)\n   vecs = AssociationMap[kron[f1, f2] . (Dot @@ Prepend[ops[[#]], IdentityMatrix[d1 d2]]) . G0i &, Subsets[Range[4]]];\n   Table[With[{sub = Select[Keys[vecs], SubsetQ[fam, #] &]},\n     Table[MatrixRank[Table[vecs[s] . h, {s, sub}, {h, grp}]], {grp, hwGroups}]], {fam, {{1, 2}, {3, 4}, {1, 2, 3, 4}}}]];\nreachRes = Table[setPoint[p]; reach[], {p, pts4}];\nGrid[Join[{Join[{\"point\", \"family\"}, (ToString[hwWt[First[#]]] <> \" (mult \" <> ToString[Length[#]] <> \")\") & /@ hwGroups]},\n   Flatten[Table[Join[{i, {\"site 1: k1, k2\", \"site 2: k3, k4\", \"both: k1..k4\"}[[j]]}, reachRes[[i, j]]], {i, 2}, {j, 3}], 1]], Frame -> All]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"677717\" data-output-id=\"73\" data-out-n=\"747\" data-sub-idx=\"5\" data-output-format=\"WLLatex\" data-output-is-graphics=\"0\" data-cell-idx=\"72\" data-sub-start=\"20\" data-sub-end=\"21\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[747]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered\" data-page-width-em=\"21\" data-latex-b64=\"\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:8.44em;vertical-align:-3.95em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:4.49em;\"><span style=\"top:-6.45em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:6.45em;\"></span><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:8.4em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-3.95em;\"></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:4.45em;\"><span style=\"top:-6.61em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">point</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-5.41em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.21em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.01em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-1.81e