      {
       "data": "Out[747]= \\begin{array}{|c|c|c|c|c|c|c|}\\hline\\text{point} & \\text{family} & \\text{\\{2, 2, 2\\} (mult 1)} & \\text{\\{3, 2, 1\\} (mult 2)} & \\text{\\{3, 3, 0\\} (mult 1)} & \\text{\\{4, 1, 1\\} (mult 1)} & \\text{\\{4, 2, 0\\} (mult 1)}\\\\\\hline1 & \\text{site 1: k1, k2} & 0 & 2 & 1 & 1 & 1\\\\\\hline1 & \\text{site 2: k3, k4} & 0 & 2 & 1 & 1 & 1\\\\\\hline1 & \\text{both: k1..k4} & 1 & 2 & 1 & 1 & 1\\\\\\hline2 & \\text{site 1: k1, k2} & 0 & 2 & 1 & 1 & 1\\\\\\hline2 & \\text{site 2: k3, k4} & 0 & 2 & 1 & 1 & 1\\\\\\hline2 & \\text{both: k1..k4} & 1 & 2 & 1 & 1 & 1\\\\\\hline\\end{array}",
       "mime": "text/plain"
      }
     ],
     "id": "78390b9d-00a9-4deb-99e8-1e9c4d1acce3"
    }
   ],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "### Finding: full reach with both sites (points 1 and 2, exact, finite twist)\n\n| family | singlet $(2,2,2)$ | octets $(3,2,1)$, mult 2 | $(3,3,0)$ | $(4,1,1)$ | $(4,2,0)$ |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| site 1: $k_1,k_2$ | 0 | 2 | 1 | 1 | 1 |\n| site 2: $k_3,k_4$ | 0 | 2 | 1 | 1 | 1 |\n| both: $k_1..k_4$ | **1** | 2 | 1 | 1 | 1 |\n\nThe product $\\langle k_1Q_1\\rangle\\langle k_2Q_{12}\\rangle\\langle k_3^{-u/h}Q^3\\rangle\\langle k_4^{-u/h}Q^{23}\\rangle$ reaches every highest-weight state of $V\\otimes V$ with full multiplicity. Each single-site family already resolves both octets; the singlet needs both sites. (Untwisting limit not checked here.)",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## Is $\\langle\\Omega|O_1O_2$ still one-body on each site?\n\nFor CG we need $\\langle\\Omega|O_1(\\theta_1)O_2(\\theta_2+2h) = a\\otimes b$ with $a$ the site-1 factor of $\\langle\\Omega|O_1$ and $b$ the site-2 factor of $\\langle\\Omega|O_2$ (so no operator ever acts on the coupled space). Test: rank of the $8\\times8$ reshaping, and equality with $a\\otimes b$ up to a scalar.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "fact[site_, vec_] := With[{m = ArrayReshape[vec, {d1, d2}]}, If[site == 1, First@Select[Transpose[m], Max[Abs[#]] > 0 &], First@Select[m, Max[Abs[#]] > 0 &]]];\noneBody = Table[setPoint[p];\n   Module[{o1 = towers[Gd, \"t\", th[1]], o2 = towers[Gd, \"tS\", th[2] + 2 hh], O1s, O2s},\n    O1s = <|\"R\" -> o1[\"t20\"] . Inverse[o1[\"t10\"]], \"t11\" -> o1[\"t11\"], \"R.t11\" -> o1[\"t20\"] . Inverse[o1[\"t10\"]] . o1[\"t11\"]|>;\n    O2s = <|\"R^S\" -> o2[\"t20\"] . Inverse[o2[\"t10\"]], \"tS11\" -> o2[\"t11\"], \"R^S.tS11\" -> o2[\"t20\"] . Inverse[o2[\"t10\"]] . o2[\"t11\"]|>;\n    Flatten[Table[With[{v = kron[f1, f2] . O1s[a] . O2s[b], av = fact[1, kron[f1, f2] . O1s[a]], bv = fact[2, kron[f1, f2] . O2s[b]]},\n       {a, b, MatrixRank[ArrayReshape[v, {d1, d2}]], MatrixRank[{v, kron[av, bv]}] == 1}], {a, Keys[O1s]}, {b, Keys[O2s]}], 1]], {p, pts4}];\nGrid[Prepend[Transpose[{oneBody[[1, All, 1]], oneBody[[1, All, 2]], oneBody[[1, All, 3]], oneBody[[1, All, 4]], oneBody[[2, All, 3]], oneBody[[2, All, 4]]}], {\"O1\", \"O2\", \"rank (pt 1)\", \"= a (x) b (pt 1)\", \"rank (pt 2)\", \"= a (x) b (pt 2)\"}], Frame -> All]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
