  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* do the one-body localized combinations reach the singlet? (exact, point 1) *)\nsingRow[c_] := {ToString[c[[1]]], With[{v = kron[f1, f2] . comboOp[c]}, {MatrixRank[ArrayReshape[v, {d1, d2}]], v . sing}]};\nsingLoc = Join[Prepend[#, 1] & /@ (singRow /@ minB1), Prepend[#, 2] & /@ (singRow /@ minB2)];\nGrid[Prepend[{#[[1]], #[[2]], #[[3, 1]], #[[3, 2]]} & /@ singLoc, {\"localized on site\", \"combination (labels)\", \"rank (1 = one-body)\", \"<Omega|O|singlet>\"}], Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
