  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* c_a(x) = kappa_a P(x): kappa ratios constant; reconstruct P = c_1/kappa_1 as a rational function N/D of low degree *)\nkap = {16, 9, -25};\nxsR = Range[0, 16]/17 + 1/9;\nPs = Table[Re[bilinFit[x, 1, -1][[4, 1]]]/kap[[1]], {x, xsR}];\nratFit[dn_, dd_] := Module[{a, b, eqs, ns},\n   eqs = Table[Sum[a[i] x^i, {i, 0, dn}] - Ps[[k]] Sum[b[j] x^j, {j, 0, dd}] /. x -> xsR[[k]], {k, Length[xsR]}];\n   ns = NullSpace[Table[Coefficient[e, #] & /@ Join[Table[a[i], {i, 0, dn}], Table[b[j], {j, 0, dd}]], {e, eqs}], Tolerance -> 10^-30];\n   If[ns === {}, None, With[{v = First[ns]}, {Sum[v[[i + 1]] u^i, {i, 0, dn}], Sum[v[[dn + 2 + j]] u^j, {j, 0, dd}]}]]];\nratRes = Select[Flatten[Table[{dn, dd, ratFit[dn, dd]}, {dn, 0, 6}, {dd, 0, 6}], 1], #[[3]] =!= None &];\nfirstRat = First@SortBy[ratRes, #[[1]] + #[[2]] &];\nrootsU[p_] := Sort@Chop[N[Flatten[Table[(r - th[s])/hh, {s, 2}, {r, u /. NSolve[p == 0, u]}]], 8], 10^-12];\n{\"(deg N, deg D)\" -> firstRat[[1 ;; 2]], \"zeros of N, (u-th_s)/h\" -> rootsU[firstRat[[3, 1]]], \"zeros of D, (u-th_s)/h\" -> rootsU[firstRat[[3, 2]]], \"N/D leading ratio\" -> N[Coefficient[firstRat[[3, 1]], u, firstRat[[1]]]/Coefficient[firstRat[[3, 2]], u, firstRat[[2]]], 10]}",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
