  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* singlet-reaching combination, nu-normalised: Y1 = Rn t11n (tS10n + a RSn) + b Rn t21n, all site-1 ops at th1 *)\ncoef221At[p_] := (setPoint[p]; Module[{P = normPieces[], o1 = towers[Gd, \"t\", th[1]], x = th[1], t11n, t21n, Rn},\n    Rn = P[\"Rn\"]; t11n = o1[\"t11\"]/(nu[1][x] nu[1][x - hh]); t21n = o1[\"t21\"]/(nu[1][x] nu[1][x + hh] nu[1][x - hh]);\n    {(th[1] - th[2])/hh, locCoefs[{Rn . t11n . P[\"tS10n\"], Rn . t11n . P[\"RSn\"], Rn . t21n}, 1]}]);\ncoef221 = coef221At /@ pts4;\nGrid[Prepend[coef221, {\"th12/h\", \"coefficients of {R t11 tS10, R t11 RS, R t21}\"}], Frame -> All]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
