   "kind": 1,
   "value": "### Findings: classification of localizing product states (point 1, exact; probe set)\n\n$V_{\\rm loc}(O;w)$ = site-1 covectors $v_1$ with $(v_1\\otimes w)O=v_1'\\otimes w$ (mirror for site 2).\n\n| $w$ on the other site | result |\n|---|---|\n| generic covector, zero-weight vectors (rotated or not) | $V_{\\rm loc}=0$ for every operator |\n| bare extremal weight vectors ($e_1,e_2,e_3,e_6,e_7,e_8$) | nonzero and invariant, but **trivial**: every localized product is a left eigen-covector of $O$ |\n| rotated extremal $w=e_1^Tg$ (any Borel; includes rotparams vacuum, $e_8^Tg$) | nontrivial, **never invariant** (cannot iterate) |\n\nFor $w=e_1^Tg$, in the frame of $g$ (i.e. $V_{\\rm loc}\\,g^{-1}$):\n\n| site-1 op at $\\theta_1$ | $V_{\\rm loc}$ | site-2 op at $\\theta_2+2h$ | $V_{\\rm loc}$ |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| $t_{10}$, $t_{20}$ | 0 | $t^S_{10}$, $t^S_{20}$ | 0 |\n| $t_{11}$ | $\\{w,\\ e_1^TE_{12}g\\}$ | $t^S_{11}$ | $\\{w,\\ e_1^TE_{23}g\\}$ |\n| $R$ | $\\{w,\\ \\text{one vector in }(2,0,1)\\oplus(1,1,1)\\}$ | $R^S$ | $\\{w,\\ \\text{one vector in }(1,2,0)\\oplus(1,1,1)\\}$ |\n| $Rt_{11}$, $t_{21}$ | $\\{w\\}$ | $R^St^S_{11}$, $t^S_{21}$ | $\\{w\\}$ |\n\nSo: the only localizing product states are \"coherent\" ones, $w$ on the orbit of the extremal vector, with the other site either equal to $w$ or differing by **one** specific relative direction per operator ($E_{12}$ for $t_{11}$, $E_{23}$ for $t^S_{11}$, an $E_{23}/E_{13}$ resp. $E_{12}/E_{13}$ mix for $R$, $R^S$). None of these spaces is preserved by its operator, so localization is a one-step property: no product-state family is closed under repeated action.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "# Nice Q-form for the site-1-localized combinations\n\nThe one-body factors are single-site SoV states on site 1, so try SoV-type factorization: $\\mathrm{eig}=C\\,\\frac{F(p)}{F(q)}\\frac{G(p')}{G(q')}$ with $F,G$ among all $Q_a$, $Q^a$, $Q_{ab}$, $Q^{ab}$ and points $\\theta_1+nh$, $n=-1..3$; $C$ state-independent. Targets: the cleaned states 110, 210, 221 and $X_1$.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* control results of the product scan (singles), then: bilinear fit for the cleaned states *)\nbilFitE[e_, x0_, al_, be_, extra_] := Module[{M, c},\n   M = Table[Join[Table[QlowA[A, a, x0 + al hh] QupA[A, a, x0 + be hh], {a, 3}], extra[A]], {A, 64}];\n   c = LeastSquares[M, e]; {al, be, N[Max[Abs[M . c - e]]/Max[Abs[e]], 3], N[c, 12]}];\nbilScan[e_, x0_, extra_] := Take[SortBy[Flatten[Table[bilFitE[e, x0, al, be, extra], {al, -2, 3}, {be, -2, 3}], 1], #[[3]] &], 2];\nconst1[A_] := {1};\nbilRes = <|\"clean 110 (th1)\" -> bilScan[targets[\"clean 110\"], th[1], const1], \"X1 (th1)\" -> bilScan[targets[\"X1\"], th[1], const1]|>;\n{\"singles: R, t11, R t11\" -> Map[#[[2, 1, 1]] &, scanRes[[1 ;; 3]]], \"bilinear fits (alpha, beta, residual)\" -> Map[#[[All, 1 ;; 3]] &, bilRes]}",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"677717\" data-output-id=\"95\" data-out-n=\"903\" data-sub-idx=\"5\" data-output-format=\"WLLatex\" data-output-is-graphics=\"0\" data-cell-idx=\"101\" data-sub-start=\"7\" data-sub-end=\"7\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[903]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered\" data-page-width-em=\"21\" data-line-broken=\"1\" data-latex-b64=\"\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:9.9101em;vertical-align:-4.705em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"col-align-r\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:5.205em;\"><span style=\"top:-7.815em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.45em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-6.305em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.45em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.805em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.45em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.695em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.45em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span><span style=\"top:0.005em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.45em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:4.705em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"col-align-l\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:5.205em;\"><span style=\"top:-7.815em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.45em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">