   "value": "(* the site-local brackets inside X1, X2: D2 = tS10n - 1/2 RSn at th2+2h, D1 = t10n - 1/2 Rn at th1 *)\nPn = normPieces[];\neD2 = eigOf[Pn[\"tS10n\"] - 1/2 Pn[\"RSn\"]]; eD1 = eigOf[Pn[\"t10n\"] - 1/2 Pn[\"Rn\"]];\n(* ratio tables at site-s points *)\nratiosAt[s_] := Module[{vt = Association@KeyValueMap[#1 -> N[Table[#2[A, th[s] + n hh], {A, 64}, {n, nPts}], 30] &, allFams]},\n   Flatten[KeyValueMap[Function[{f, v}, Table[If[Min[Abs[v[[All, j]]]] > 10^-20 && i != j, {{f, nPts[[i]], nPts[[j]]}, v[[All, i]]/v[[All, j]]}, Nothing], {i, Length[nPts]}, {j, Length[nPts]}]], vt], 2]];\nprodScanR[e_, rts_] := Module[{eN = N[e, 30], best = {}, s},\n   Do[s = spreadOf[eN/rts[[i, 2]]]; If[s < 10^-12, AppendTo[best, {rts[[i, 1]], s}]], {i, Length[rts]}];\n   If[best =!= {}, Return[{\"single\", Take[best, UpTo[4]]}]];\n   Do[s = spreadOf[eN/(rts[[i, 2]] rts[[j, 2]])]; If[s < 10^-12, AppendTo[best, {rts[[i, 1]], rts[[j, 1]], s}]], {i, Length[rts]}, {j, i, Length[rts]}];\n   {\"product\", Take[best, UpTo[4]]}];\n{\"D2 = tS10n - RSn/2 at th2+2h\" -> prodScanR[eD2, ratiosAt[2]], \"D1 = t10n - Rn/2 at th1\" -> prodScanR[eD1, ratiosAt[1]]}",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
