  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* SoV-type ansatz on site 1: eig = sum_{a,b} c_ab Q1(th1+a h) Q12(th1+b h) / (Q1(th1+h) Q12(th1)) *)\nQ12f = allFams[\"Q_12\"];\nsovBasis[s_, aR_, bR_] := Association@Flatten@Table[{a, b} -> Table[QlowA[A, 1, th[s] + a hh] Q12f[A, th[s] + b hh]/(QlowA[A, 1, th[s] + hh] Q12f[A, th[s]]), {A, 64}], {a, aR}, {b, bR}];\nsovFit[e_, basis_] := Module[{M = N[Transpose[Values[basis]], 40], c}, c = LeastSquares[M, N[e, 40]];\n   {N[Max[Abs[M . c - e]]/Max[Abs[e]], 3], Select[Thread[Keys[basis] -> Chop[c, 10^-25]], #[[2]] =!= 0 &]}];\nsb1 = sovBasis[1, Range[-1, 3], Range[-1, 3]];\n(* controls: the singles must come out as one term each *)\nsovRes = Map[sovFit[#, sb1] &, KeyTake[targets, {\"single 200 (R)\", \"single 111 (t11)\", \"single 211 (R t11)\", \"clean 110\", \"clean 210\", \"clean 221\", \"X1\"}]];\nMap[{#[[1]], Length[#[[2]]]} &, sovRes]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
