  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "### Findings: searching for a nice Q-form (point 1) — negative so far\n\n- **Singles** ($R$, $t_{11}$, $Rt_{11}$ at $\\theta_1$) are single ratios / products, in several equivalent ways (Wronskian zeros at $\\theta_1+nh$ make $Q_a(\\theta_1+2h)/Q_a(\\theta_1+h)$ the same for all $a$, and $Q^a(\\theta_1+h)/Q^a(\\theta_1)$ likewise). They lie in the SoV-type span $\\{Q_1(\\theta_1+a h)Q_{12}(\\theta_1+b h)\\}/(Q_1(\\theta_1+h)Q_{12}(\\theta_1))$.\n- **Cleaned 110, 210, 221 and $X_1$ fail every compact ansatz tried** (relative residual 0.4–0.9): single ratio, product of two ratios (all $Q_a,Q^a,Q_{ab},Q^{ab}$ at $\\theta_1+nh$), reweighted bilinear $\\sum_ac_aQ_a Q^a$, linear combination of $\\tau_{1,2}(\\theta_1+nh)$, and the full site-1 SoV-type span above. The site-local pieces $t^S_{10}-\\frac12R^S$ and $t_{10}-\\frac12R$ are not products of ratios either.\n- So although these covectors are one-body on site 1, their overlaps with the two-site $\\Psi$ are **not** functions of site-1 Q-data: the site-2 dressing leaves genuine site-2 dependence. The only closed Q-form available is the explicit sum (bilinears + ratios) found above.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "# True SoV basis: B-operator eigenvectors (companion frame, adjoint ⊗ adjoint, point 1)\n\n$B(u)=T_{11}(u)\\,QM_{12,12}(u+h)+T_{21}(u)\\,QM_{12,13}(u+h)$ from the untwisted two-site monodromy (as in `Companion-B-C-diagonalize.wb`). Check it commutes with itself, diagonalise exactly, read off the SoV labels from the roots of its eigenvalues.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* exact left eigenvectors of B, their eigenvalue polynomials and roots *)\nxB = Table[First@NullSpace[Transpose[Bu0] - lam IdentityMatrix[d1 d2]], {lam, Bev}];\nuB = Range[0, 7]/5 + 1/13;\nBvals = Table[With[{Bx = Bop[x]}, Table[With[{r = xB[[k]] . Bx, j = First@FirstPosition[xB[[k]], _?(# != 0 &)]}, r[[j]]/xB[[k, j]]], {k, 64}]], {x, uB}];\nBpoly = Table[Factor@InterpolatingPolynomial[Transpose[{uB, Bvals[[All, k]]}], u], {k, 64}];\n(* roots of the non-constant part, as (root - th_s)/h with the site s they belong to *)\nlabelOf[p_] := Sort@Flatten[Table[With[{r = u /. s0}, Select[Table[{s, (r - th[s])/hh}, {s, 2}], IntegerQ[#[[2]]] &]], {s0, Solve[p == 0, u]}], 1];\nBlabels = labelOf /@ Bpoly;\n{\"eigenvalue degree\" -> Union[Exponent[#, u] & /@ Bpoly], \"# distinct labels\" -> Length[Union[Blabels]], \"sample labels\" -> Take[Blabels, 4]}",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
