  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* per-site structure: labels k <-> (site-1 triple, site-2 triple) *)\nkOf = AssociationThread[Transpose[{site1Lab, site2Lab}], Range[64]];\nl1s = Union[site1Lab]; l2s = Union[site2Lab];\nref1 = site1Lab[[k0]]; ref2 = site2Lab[[k0]];\nWk[l1_, l2_] := Wf[[kOf[{l1, l2}]]];\n(* separability: W(i,j) W(0,0) = W(i,0) W(0,j) *)\nsepErr = Max@Flatten@Table[Abs[Wk[a, b] Wk[ref1, ref2] - Wk[a, ref2] Wk[ref1, b]]/Max[Abs[Wk[a, b] Wk[ref1, ref2]]], {a, l1s}, {b, l2s}];\n(* site factors relative to the reference *)\nF1 = Association@Table[a -> Wk[a, ref2]/Wk[ref1, ref2], {a, l1s}];\nF2 = Association@Table[b -> Wk[ref1, b]/Wk[ref1, ref2], {b, l2s}];\nrat1 = ratiosAt[1]; rat2 = ratiosAt[2];\n{\"separability error\" -> N[sepErr, 3], \"reference labels\" -> {ref1, ref2}}",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
