  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "### B from the untwisted monodromy: wavefunctions do NOT separate between sites (error ~17)\n\nRedo with $B$ built from the **companion-twisted** monodromy $T G_c$ (companion frame throughout).",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "xBC = Table[First@NullSpace[Transpose[Bu0C] - lam IdentityMatrix[d1 d2]], {lam, BevC}];\nBvalsC = Table[With[{Bx = BopC[x]}, Table[With[{r = xBC[[k]] . Bx, j = First@FirstPosition[xBC[[k]], _?(# != 0 &)]}, r[[j]]/xBC[[k, j]]], {k, 64}]], {x, uB}];\nBpolyC = Table[Factor@InterpolatingPolynomial[Transpose[{uB, BvalsC[[All, k]]}], u], {k, 64}];\nBlabelsC = labelOf /@ BpolyC;\ns1C = Map[Cases[#, {1, n_} :> n] &, BlabelsC]; s2C = Map[Cases[#, {2, n_} :> n] &, BlabelsC];\nWfC = Table[N[xBC[[k]], prec] . psiC[[A]], {k, 64}, {A, 64}];\nkOfC = AssociationThread[Transpose[{s1C, s2C}], Range[64]];\nl1C = Union[s1C]; l2C = Union[s2C];\n{r1C, r2C} = {First[l1C], First[l2C]};\nWkC[a_, b_] := WfC[[kOfC[{a, b}]]];\nsepErrC = Max@Flatten@Table[Abs[WkC[a, b] WkC[r1C, r2C] - WkC[a, r2C] WkC[r1C, b]]/Max[Abs[WkC[a, b] WkC[r1C, r2C]]], {a, l1C}, {b, l2C}];\n{\"degree\" -> Union[Exponent[#, u] & /@ BpolyC], \"site-1 labels\" -> l1C, \"site-2 labels\" -> l2C, \"product structure\" -> (Length[kOfC] == 64), \"separability error\" -> N[sepErrC, 3]}",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
