      },
      {
       "data": "Out[969]= \\begin{aligned}\n  &\\left\\{\\text{degree}\\to \\left\\{6\\right\\},\\text{site-1 labels} \\right. \\\\\n  &\\left. \\to \\begin{pmatrix}-1 & 0 & 1\\\\-1 & 0 & 2\\\\-1 & 1 & 1\\\\-1 & 1 & 2\\\\-1 & 2 & 2\\\\0 & 1 & 1\\\\0 & 1 & 2\\\\0 & 2 & 2\\end{pmatrix} \\right. \\\\\n  &\\left. ,\\text{site-2 labels} \\right. \\\\\n  &\\left. \\to \\begin{pmatrix}-1 & 0 & 1\\\\-1 & 0 & 2\\\\-1 & 1 & 1\\\\-1 & 1 & 2\\\\-1 & 2 & 2\\\\0 & 1 & 1\\\\0 & 1 & 2\\\\0 & 2 & 2\\end{pmatrix} \\right. \\\\\n  &\\left. ,\\text{product structure}\\to \\mathrm{True} \\right. \\\\\n  &\\left. ,\\text{separability error}\\to 2.77\\right\\}\n\\end{aligned}",
       "mime": "text/plain"
      }
     ],
     "id": "ac2596aa-446d-4e7d-a66e-e88c9c1aefbe"
    }
   ],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "### Correction: separability must be tested up to per-label scale\n\n$W_{ij}W_{00}/(W_{i0}W_{0j})$ state-independent: **untwisted** $B$ (as in `Companion-B-C-diagonalize.wb`): exact ($\\sim10^{-55}$); twisted $B$: fails. So the untwisted $B$ is the SoV $B$ in the companion frame. Now the Q-form of the site factors $F_1(a)=W_{a,0}/W_{0,0}$, $F_2(b)=W_{0,b}/W_{0,0}$ (reference labels $\\{-1,1,1\\}$ on both sites).",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* up to three ratios, restricted families, for the unmatched site factors *)\nratRestrict[rts_, fams_] := Select[rts, MemberQ[fams, #[[1, 1]]] &];\ntripleScan[e_, rts_] := Module[{eN = N[e, 30], n = Length[rts], hits = {}, s},\n   Do[s = spreadOf[eN/(rts[[i, 2]] rts[[j, 2]] rts[[k, 2]])]; If[s < 10^-12, AppendTo[hits, {rts[[i, 1]], rts[[j, 1]], rts[[k, 1]]}]; If[Length[hits] >= 3, Return[hits, Module]]],\n    {i, n}, {j, i, n}, {k, j, n}]; hits];\nfamsT = {\"Q_1\", \"Q_12\", \"Q^3\", \"Q^23\"};\nr1T = ratRestrict[rat1, famsT];\nunmatched1 = Select[siteScan, #[[1]] == 1 && #[[3, 2]] === {} &][[All, 2]];\ntriple1 = Table[{a, tripleScan[F1[a], r1T]}, {a, unmatched1}];\n{\"# ratios used\" -> Length[r1T], \"site-1 unmatched\" -> triple1}",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
