   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "### Findings: SoV basis of the untwisted $B$ in the companion frame (point 1)\n\n- $B(u)=T_{11}(u)QM_{12,12}(u+h)+T_{21}(u)QM_{12,13}(u+h)$, untwisted $T$: commuting, 64 distinct rational eigenvalues of degree 6; roots $\\theta_s+nh$, three per site, 8 patterns per site, full product structure $8\\times8$. Site labels: $\\{-1,0,1\\},\\{-1,0,2\\},\\{-1,1,1\\},\\{-1,1,2\\},\\{-1,2,2\\},\\{0,1,1\\},\\{0,1,2\\},\\{0,2,2\\}$.\n- Wavefunctions $\\langle x|\\Psi\\rangle$ (with $\\Psi^c=\\Pi(P)\\Psi^d$) **separate exactly** between sites (up to per-label constants, $\\sim10^{-55}$). The twisted $B$ (from $TG_c$) does not.\n- Site factors relative to $\\{-1,1,1\\}$ (same on both sites): $\\{-1,1,2\\}\\to Q_1(\\theta+2h)/Q_1(\\theta+h)$, $\\{-1,2,2\\}\\to(Q_1(\\theta+2h)/Q_1(\\theta+h))^2$, i.e. $Q_1$ at the two upper roots. The five labels with a root at $0$ are **not** products of $\\le3$ ratios of $Q_1,Q_{12},Q^3,Q^{23}$ (nor $\\le2$ of any family).",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "### Ryan–Volin wave function (arXiv:2002.12341, eq. 5.22)\n\n$\\Psi(x)=\\prod_\\alpha q_{\\sigma(1)}(x_{\\alpha,11})\\det_{1\\le i,j\\le2}q_{\\sigma(i)}(x_{\\alpha,2j})$, $x_{kj}=\\theta+h(\\mu_{kj}-j+1)$. For the adjoint: $x_{22}\\in\\{\\theta-h,\\theta\\}$ (first root), $x_{21}\\in\\{\\theta+h,\\theta+2h\\}$, $x_{11}$ the remaining root. Test $F(\\text{label})\\propto Q_a(x_{11})\\,[Q_a(x_{21})Q_b(x_{22})-Q_b(x_{21})Q_a(x_{22})]$ for each ordered pair $(a,b)$, up to per-label constants.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* general scan: root assignment perm (x11, x21, x22 = lab[[perm]]) x family pair; also upper Q's *)\nfamPairs = Join[Flatten[Table[{\"low\", a, b}, {a, 3}, {b, 3}], 1], Flatten[Table[{\"up\", a, b}, {a, 3}, {b, 3}], 1]] // Select[#, #[[2]] != #[[3]] &] &;\nqq[\"low\", a_][A_, x_] := QlowA[A, a, x]; qq[\"up\", a_][A_, x_] := QupA[A, a, x];\nrvG[{t_, a_, b_}, perm_][s_, lab_][A_] := With[{x = th[s] + hh lab[[perm]]},\n   qq[t, a][A, x[[1]]] (qq[t, a][A, x[[2]]] qq[t, b][A, x[[3]]] - qq[t, b][A, x[[2]]] qq[t, a][A, x[[3]]])];\n(* labels sorted; test on site 1 only first *)\nrvScore[fp_, perm_] := Max@Table[Quiet@spreadOf[Table[F1[l][[A]]/(rvG[fp, perm][1, l][A]/rvG[fp, perm][1, ref1][A]), {A, 64}]], {l, l1s}];\nrvScan = SortBy[Flatten[Table[{fp, perm, N[rvScore[fp, perm], 3]}, {fp, famPairs}, {perm, Permutations[{1, 2, 3}]}], 1], #[[3]] &];\nTake[rvScan, 4]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
