  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* SoV wave function per site, sorted roots r1 <= r2 <= r3 (units of h): Q1(r3) [Q1(r1) Q2(r2) - Q2(r1) Q1(r2)] *)\nsiteWF[s_, lab_][A_] := rvG[{\"low\", 1, 2}, {3, 1, 2}][s, lab][A];\n(* full two-site check: W_k(A) / (siteWF1 siteWF2) must be state-independent for every label k *)\nfullRV = Max@Table[spreadOf[Table[WkC0[k][[A]]/(siteWF[1, site1Lab[[k]]][A] siteWF[2, site2Lab[[k]]][A]), {A, 64}]], {k, 64}] /. WkC0[k_] :> Wf[[k]];\nsite2RV = Max@Table[spreadOf[Table[F2[l][[A]]/(siteWF[2, l][A]/siteWF[2, ref2][A]), {A, 64}]], {l, l2s}];\n{\"site 2 factors\" -> N[site2RV, 3], \"all 64 two-site wave functions\" -> N[fullRV, 3]}",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
