  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "### All 64 SoV wave functions match Ryan–Volin (5.22) ($\\sim10^{-49}$)\n\nWith sorted roots $r_1\\le r_2\\le r_3$ per site (units of $h$ above $\\theta_s$): $\\langle x|\\Psi\\rangle\\propto\\prod_sQ_1(r^s_3)\\,[Q_1(r^s_1)Q_2(r^s_2)-Q_2(r^s_1)Q_1(r^s_2)]$, i.e. $x_{11}=r_3$ and $\\{x_{21},x_{22}\\}=\\{r_1,r_2\\}$ ($\\sigma=$ id). Now: which B-eigenvectors are product states?",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* localized space V* (x) w in the SoV basis, w = common site-2 factor of the label-{-1,0,1} product states *)\nkw = Select[Range[64], site2Lab[[#]] == {-1, 0, 1} && rankB[[#]] == 1 &];\nwSoV = fact[2, xB[[First[kw]]]];\nsovSt = AssociationThread[Transpose[{site1Lab, site2Lab}], xB];\nminimalSoV[wv_, maxn_] := Module[{V = Table[kron[UnitVector[d1, k], wv], {k, d1}], labs, found = {}, newF},\n   labs = Keys[sovSt][[Union@Flatten[Position[#, _?(# != 0 &)] & /@ NullSpace[Transpose[Join[Values[sovSt], V]]][[All, 1 ;; 64]]]]];\n   Do[newF = Select[Subsets[labs, {n}], Function[sub, Not@AnyTrue[found, SubsetQ[sub, #[[1]]] &] && Length[NullSpace[Transpose[Join[sovSt /@ sub, V]]]] > 0]];\n    found = Join[found, Table[{sub, With[{c = First[NullSpace[Transpose[Join[sovSt /@ sub, V]]]][[1 ;; n]]}, c/c[[1]]]}, {sub, newF}]], {n, 1, maxn}];\n   {Length[labs], found}];\nminSoV = minimalSoV[wSoV, 3];\nsingSoV = Table[{c[[1]], Sum[c[[2, i]] sovSt[c[[1, i]]], {i, Length[c[[1]]]}] . sing}, {c, minSoV[[2]]}];\n{\"site-2 factor w (weights with nonzero entries)\" -> Pick[wtsV, Unitize[wSoV], 1], \"# SoV labels involved\" -> minSoV[[1]], \"# minimal combos\" -> Length[minSoV[[2]]]}",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"677717\" data-output-id=\"111\" data-out-n=\"1004\" data-sub-idx=\"7\" data-output-format=\"WLLatex\" data-output-is-graphics=\"0\" data-cell-idx=\"119\" data-sub-start=\"11\" data-sub-end=\"11\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[1004]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered\" data-page-width-em=\"22\" data-line-broken=\"1\" data-latex-b64=\"\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:4.51em;vertical-align:-2.005em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"col-align-r\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.505em;\"><span style=\"top:-4.515em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.85em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.005em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.85em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-1.505em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.85em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.005em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"col-align-l\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.505em;\"><span style=\"top:-4.665em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">{</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">site-2 factor w (weights with nonzero 