       "data": "Out[1004]= \\begin{aligned}\n  &\\left\\{\\text{site-2 factor w (weights with nonzero entries)} \\right. \\\\\n  &\\left. \\to \\begin{pmatrix}0 & 1 & 2\\end{pmatrix},\\text{\\# SoV labels involved}\\to 12 \\right. \\\\\n  &\\left. ,\\text{\\# minimal combos}\\to 8\\right\\}\n\\end{aligned}",
