  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* Q-form of each localized combination in Ryan-Volin normalisation: <C|Psi>/<x_ref|Psi> = sum_i alpha_i Phi(label_i)/Phi(ref) *)\nPhi[{l1_, l2_}][A_] := siteWF[1, l1][A] siteWF[2, l2][A];\nrefLab = {ref1, ref2};\nrvFit[c_] := Module[{e = Table[(Sum[c[[2, i]] N[sovSt[c[[1, i]]], prec], {i, Length[c[[1]]]}] . psiC[[A]])/(N[sovSt[refLab], prec] . psiC[[A]]), {A, 64}], M, al},\n   M = Table[Phi[l][A]/Phi[refLab][A], {A, 64}, {l, c[[1]]}]; al = LeastSquares[M, e];\n   {c[[1]], N[Max[Abs[M . al - e]]/Max[Abs[e]], 3], Rationalize[Chop[al, 10^-30], 10^-25]}];\nrvCombos = rvFit /@ minSoV[[2]];\nGrid[Prepend[{#[[1]], #[[2]], #[[3]]} & /@ rvCombos, {\"SoV labels (site 1 | site 2)\", \"residual\", \"alpha (Ryan-Volin normalisation)\"}], Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"677717\" data-output-id=\"112\" data-out-n=\"1009\" data-sub-idx=\"5\" data-output-format=\"WLLatex\" data-output-is-graphics=\"0\" data-cell-idx=\"120\" data-sub-start=\"7\" data-sub-end=\"7\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[1009]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered\" data-page-width-em=\"22\" data-latex-b64=\"\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:15.6801em;vertical-align:-7.5701em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:8.1101em;\"><span style=\"top:-10.0701em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:10.0701em;\"></span><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:15.6401em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-7.5701em;\"></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:8.0701em;\"><span style=\"top:-10.6801em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.45em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">SoV labels (site 1 | site 2)</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-9.4701em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.45em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.85em;\"