      {
       "data": "Out[1009]= \\begin{array}{|c|c|c|}\\hline\\text{SoV labels (site 1 | site 2)} & \\text{residual} & \\text{alpha (Ryan-Volin normalisation)}\\\\\\hline\\begin{pmatrix}\\left\\{0,1,2\\right\\} & \\left\\{-1,0,1\\right\\}\\end{pmatrix} & 0.\\times 10^{-50} & \\left\\{-\\frac{231}{650}\\right\\}\\\\\\hline\\begin{pmatrix}\\left\\{-1,0,2\\right\\} & \\left\\{-1,0,1\\right\\}\\end{pmatrix} & 0.\\times 10^{-49} & \\left\\{-\\frac{10857}{22100}\\right\\}\\\\\\hline\\begin{pmatrix}\\left\\{0,1,1\\right\\} & \\left\\{-1,0,1\\right\\}\\end{pmatrix} & 0.\\times 10^{-50} & \\left\\{-\\frac{231}{1300}\\right\\}\\\\\\hline\\begin{pmatrix}\\left\\{-1,0,1\\right\\} & \\left\\{-1,0,1\\right\\}\\end{pmatrix} & 0.\\times 10^{-49} & \\left\\{-\\frac{3619}{11050}\\right\\}\\\\\\hline\\begin{pmatrix}\\left\\{-1,2,2\\right\\} & \\left\\{-1,0,1\\right\\}\\\\\\left\\{-1,1,2\\right\\} & \\left\\{-1,0,2\\right\\}\\end{pmatrix} & 0.\\times 10^{-50} & \\left\\{\\frac{423}{2600},\\frac{32571}{22100}\\right\\}\\\\\\hline\\begin{pmatrix}\\left\\{-1,1,2\\right\\} & \\left\\{-1,0,1\\right\\}\\\\\\left\\{-1,0,2\\right\\} & \\left\\{-1,0,2\\right\\}\\end{pmatrix} & 0.\\times 10^{-49} & \\left\\{\\frac{423}{2600},\\frac{32571}{44200}\\right\\}\\\\\\hline\\begin{pmatrix}\\left\\{-1,1,1\\right\\} & \\left\\{-1,0,1\\right\\}\\\\\\left\\{-1,0,1\\right\\} & \\left\\{-1,0,2\\right\\}\\end{pmatrix… [latex truncated: 1491 chars total]",
