\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">}</span></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">}</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:8.1501em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div></div></div>",
