      {
       "data": "Out[1013]= \\begin{aligned}\n  &\\left\\{\\text{T (point 2)}\\to \\frac{206}{221},\\text{pair ratios} \\right. \\\\\n  &\\left. \\to \\begin{pmatrix}\\begin{pmatrix}\\left\\{-1,1,2\\right\\} & \\left\\{-1,0,2\\right\\}\\\\\\left\\{-1,2,2\\right\\} & \\left\\{-1,0,1\\right\\}\\end{pmatrix} & -\\frac{118}{221}\\\\\\begin{pmatrix}\\left\\{-1,1,2\\right\\} & \\left\\{-1,0,1\\right\\}\\\\\\left\\{-1,0,2\\right\\} & \\left\\{-1,0,2\\right\\}\\end{pmatrix} & -\\frac{221}{236}\\\\\\begin{pmatrix}\\left\\{-1,1,1\\right\\} & \\left\\{-1,0,1\\right\\}\\\\\\left\\{-1,0,1\\right\\} & \\left\\{-1,0,2\\right\\}\\end{pmatrix} & -\\frac{94367}{97232}\\\\\\begin{pmatrix}\\left\\{0,1,2\\right\\} & \\left\\{-1,0,2\\right\\}\\\\\\left\\{0,2,2\\right\\} & \\left\\{-1,0,1\\right\\}\\end{pmatrix} & -\\frac{15}{221}\\end{pmatrix} \\right. \\\\\n  &\\left. ,\\text{predictions 2/(T-2), 1/(T-2), (T+1)/(2T(T-2)), 1/(T-1)} \\right. \\\\\n  &\\left. \\to \\left\\{-\\frac{221}{118},-\\frac{221}{236},-\\frac{94367}{97232},-\\frac{221}{15}\\right\\}\\right\\}\n\\end{aligned}",
       "mime": "text/plain"
      }
     ],
     "id": "a2537b73-9214-4425-be1c-6ae851c0ae4e"
    }
   ],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "### Findings: one-body localized states in the true SoV basis, with Q-forms (companion frame; points 1 and 2)\n\nSite factor (Ryan–Volin 5.22, monic $Q$'s, roots $r_1\\le r_2\\le r_3$ in units of $h$): $\\Phi_s(r)=Q_1(\\theta_s+r_3h)\\,D_s(r_1,r_2)$, $D_s(a,b)=Q_1(\\theta_s+ah)Q_2(\\theta_s+bh)-Q_2(\\theta_s+ah)Q_1(\\theta_s+bh)$.\n\nLocalized on site 1 means $\\langle v|\\otimes e_8^T$ (site 2 in the **unrotated lowest-weight** state; SoV label $\\{-1,0,1\\}$). The 8-dim space of such covectors is spanned by (only 12 SoV labels):\n\n- **4 single SoV states**: site-1 labels $\\{0,1,2\\},\\{-1,0,2\\},\\{0,1,1\\},\\{-1,0,1\\}$ with site-2 label $\\{-1,0,1\\}$. Q-form: $\\Phi_1(l_1)\\Phi_2(-1,0,1)$.\n- **4 pairs** $\\langle x_{l_1^+|\\{-1,0,1\\}}|+\\dots\\langle x_{l_1|\\{-1,0,2\\}}|$. Since $\\Phi_2(-1,0,2)/\\Phi_2(-1,0,1)=Q_1(\\theta_2+2h)/Q_1(\\theta_2+h)\\equiv\\rho_2$, the overlap is\n$$\\langle C|\\Psi\\rangle\\ \\propto\\ \\Phi_2(-1,0,1)\\,\\big[\\Phi_1(l_1^+)+c\\,\\Phi_1(l_1)\\,\\rho_2\\big],\\qquad T=\\theta_{12}/h:$$\n\n| $l_1^+$ | $l_1$ | $c$ | singlet |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| $\\{-1,2,2\\}$ | $\\{-1,1,2\\}$ | $2/(T-2)$ | 0 |\n| $\\{-1,1,2\\}$ | $\\{-1,0,2\\}$ | $1/(T-2)$ | 0 |\n| $\\{-1,1,1\\}$ | $\\{-1,0,1\\}$ | $(T+1)/(2T(T-2))$ | 0 |\n| $\\{0,2,2\\}$ | $\\{0,1,2\\}$ | $1/(T-1)$ | **$\\neq0$** |\n\nAll $c$ confirmed at points 1 and 2 (residuals $\\sim10^{-48}$). The singlet-reaching one-body functional is\n$$\\langle C_s|\\Psi\\rangle\\ \\propto\\ Q_1(\\theta_1+2h)\\Big[D_1(0,2)+\\frac{h}{\\theta_{12}-h}\\,D_1(0,1)\\,\\frac{Q_1(\\theta_2+2h)}{Q_1(\\theta_2+h)}\\Big]\\,\\Phi_2(-1,0,1).$$",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* companion-frame recipe states <0| O_g1(th1) O_g2(th2), <0| = e8 (x) e8, and their match to the B-eigenvectors *)\nvac0 = kron[ext[1, False], ext[2, False]];\nrecC = Module[{O1 = Og[towers[Gc, \"t\", th[1]]], O2 = Og[towers[Gc, \"t\", th[2]]]},\n   Association@Flatten@Table[{g1, g2} -> vac0 . O1[g1] . O2[g2], {g1, gLabels}, {g2, gLabels}]];\n(* which B-eigenvector (root label) is each recipe state proportional to? *)\nmatchB = Association@KeyValueMap[#1 -> Select[Keys[sovSt], Function[k, MatrixRank[{sovSt[k], #2}] == 1]] &, recC];\n{\"all recipe states are B-eigenvectors\" -> AllTrue[Values[matchB], Length[#] == 1 &], \"bijective\" -> (Length[Union[Flatten[Values[matchB], 1]]] == 64)}",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"677717\" data-output-id=\"114\" data-out-n=\"1017\" data-sub-idx=\"5\" data-output-format=\"WLLatex\" data-output-is-graphics=\"0\" data-cell-idx=\"123\" data-sub-start=\"6\" data-sub-end=\"6\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[1017]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered\" data-page-width-em=\"21\" data-line-broken=\"1\" data-latex-b64=\"XGJlZ2lue2FsaWduZWR9CiAgJlxsZWZ0XHtcdGV4dHthbGwgcmVjaXBlIHN0YXRlcyBhcmUgQi1laWdlbnZlY3RvcnN9XHRvIFxtYXRocm17VHJ1ZX0gXHJpZ2h0LiBcXAogICZcbGVmdC4gLFx0ZXh0e2JpamVjdGl2ZX1cdG8gXG1hdGhybXtUcnVlfVxyaWdodFx9ClxlbmR7YWxpZ25lZH0=\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:3em;vertical-align:-1.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"col-align-r\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.75em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.75em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.84em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.25em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.84em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.25em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"col-align-l\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.75em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.91em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">{</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">all recipe states are B-eigenvectors</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">True</span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.41em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">bijective</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">True</span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">}</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.25em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div></div></div>",
       "mime": "x-application/wolfram-language-html"
      },
      {
       "data": "Out[1017]= \\begin{aligned}\n  &\\left\\{\\text{all recipe states are B-eigenvectors}\\to \\mathrm{True} \\right. \\\\\n  &\\left. ,\\text{bijective}\\to \\mathrm{True}\\right\\}\n\\end{aligned}",
       "mime": "text/plain"
      }
     ],
     "id": "3ef66544-0f4a-482b-8522-2d8e0186e152"
    }
   ],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* root label <-> GT label, per site *)\nrootToGT1 = Association@Union@KeyValueMap[#2[[1, 1]] -> #1[[1]] &, matchB];\nrootToGT2 = Association@Union@KeyValueMap[#2[[1, 2]] -> #1[[2]] &, matchB];\n(* localized combinations directly in the recipe basis, with recipe-normalised coefficients *)\nrecipeCombos[] := Module[{V = Table[kron[UnitVector[d1, k], ext[2, False]], {k, d1}]},\n   Table[With[{gl = {rootToGT1[#[[1]]], rootToGT2[#[[2]]]} & /@ c[[1]]},\n     With[{ns = First@NullSpace[Transpose[Join[recC /@ gl, V]]][[1 ;; Length[gl]]]}, {gl, ns/ns[[1]], Sum[(ns/ns[[1]])[[i]] recC[gl[[i]]], {i, Length[gl]}] . sing}]], {c, minSoV[[2]]}]];\nrcP2 = recipeCombos[];\nGrid[Prepend[{#[[1]], #[[2]], N[#[[3]], 4]} & /@ rcP2, {\"GT labels (site 1, site 2)\", \"coefficients\", \"singlet overlap\"}], Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
