  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* rank of each SoV covector as 8x8, and whether the site-2 factor depends only on the site-2 label *)\nrankB = Table[MatrixRank[ArrayReshape[xB[[k]], {d1, d2}]], {k, 64}];\nprodLabels = Table[{site1Lab[[k]], site2Lab[[k]]}, {k, Flatten@Position[rankB, 1]}];\nsite2FactorConst = Table[With[{ks = Select[Range[64], site2Lab[[#]] == l2 && rankB[[#]] == 1 &]}, {l2, Length[ks], If[Length[ks] > 1, MatrixRank[fact[2, xB[[#]]] & /@ ks] == 1, \"-\"]}], {l2, l2s}];\n{\"rank distribution\" -> Tally[rankB], \"site-2 labels: # product states, common site-2 factor\" -> site2FactorConst}",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
