  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* site factors (up to per-label constants) as products of <= 2 ratios at that site's points *)\nsiteScan = Join[\n   Table[{1, a, prodScanR[F1[a], rat1]}, {a, DeleteCases[l1s, ref1]}],\n   Table[{2, b, prodScanR[F2[b], rat2]}, {b, DeleteCases[l2s, ref2]}]];\nGrid[Prepend[{#[[1]], #[[2]], #[[3, 1]], If[#[[3, 2]] === {}, \"none\", #[[3, 2, 1]]]} & /@ siteScan, {\"site\", \"label (roots - th)/h\", \"type\", \"first match\"}], Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
