  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "qmC[{i1_, i2_}, {j1_, j2_}][x_] := TGp[Gc][{i1, j1}][x] . TGp[Gc][{i2, j2}][x - hh] - TGp[Gc][{i2, j1}][x] . TGp[Gc][{i1, j2}][x - hh];\nBopC[x_] := TGp[Gc][{1, 1}][x] . qmC[{1, 2}, {1, 2}][x + hh] + TGp[Gc][{2, 1}][x] . qmC[{1, 2}, {1, 3}][x + hh];\nBcommC = Max@Abs@Flatten[BopC[1/7] . BopC[-3/5] - BopC[-3/5] . BopC[1/7]];\nBu0C = BopC[2/9];\nBevC = Eigenvalues[Transpose[Bu0C]];\n{\"[B(u),B(v)]\" -> BcommC, \"# distinct eigenvalues\" -> Length[Union[BevC]], \"rational\" -> AllTrue[BevC, Head[#] === Rational || IntegerQ[#] &]}",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
