  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "setPoint[pts4[[1]]];\n(* untwisted 2x2 quantum minors: first column at u, second at u - h *)\nqmU[{i1_, i2_}, {j1_, j2_}][x_] := T[{i1, j1}][x] . T[{i2, j2}][x - hh] - T[{i2, j1}][x] . T[{i1, j2}][x - hh];\nBop[x_] := T[{1, 1}][x] . qmU[{1, 2}, {1, 2}][x + hh] + T[{2, 1}][x] . qmU[{1, 2}, {1, 3}][x + hh];\nBcomm = Max@Abs@Flatten[Bop[1/7] . Bop[-3/5] - Bop[-3/5] . Bop[1/7]];\n(* exact left eigenvectors at a generic point; eigenvalues are polynomials in u with roots th_s + n h *)\nBu0 = Bop[2/9];\nBev = Eigenvalues[Transpose[Bu0]];\n{\"[B(u),B(v)]\" -> Bcomm, \"# distinct eigenvalues\" -> Length[Union[Bev]], \"eigenvalues rational\" -> AllTrue[Bev, Head[#] === Rational || IntegerQ[#] &]}",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
