       "data": "Out[926]= \\begin{aligned}\n  &\\left\\{\\text{[B(u),B(v)]}\\to 0,\\text{\\# distinct eigenvalues}\\to 64 \\right. \\\\\n  &\\left. ,\\text{eigenvalues rational}\\to \\mathrm{True}\\right\\}\n\\end{aligned}",
