       "data": "Out[804]= \\begin{aligned}\n  &\\left\\{\\text{Baxter residuals (q\\^{}1, q\\_3)}\\to 0.\\times 10^{-51} \\right. \\\\\n  &\\left. ,\\text{best 3 (alpha, beta, residual, c)} \\right. \\\\\n  &\\left. \\to \\begin{pmatrix}1 & -1 & 0.\\times 10^{-49} & \\left\\{1.089901543+0.\\times 10^{-10}\\,\\mathrm{i},0.6130696181+0.\\times 10^{-10}\\,\\mathrm{i},-1.702971161+0.\\times 10^{-10}\\,\\mathrm{i}\\right\\}\\\\1 & -2 & 0.549 & \\left\\{0.07228296199+0.\\times 10^{-11}\\,\\mathrm{i},-0.07341521075+0.\\times 10^{-11}\\,\\mathrm{i},-0.1135558134+0.\\times 10^{-11}\\,\\mathrm{i}\\right\\}\\\\2 & -1 & 0.577 & \\left\\{0.07039355373+0.\\times 10^{-11}\\,\\mathrm{i},-0.06307954245+0.\\times 10^{-11}\\,\\mathrm{i},-0.1102646699+0.\\times 10^{-11}\\,\\mathrm{i}\\right\\}\\end{pmatrix}\\right\\}\n\\end{aligned}",
