   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* conjugated by the reference rotation g0 (the operator acts before g0 is undone): w = w0 . (g0 M g0^-1) *)\nG0 = g0[1];\nconjOps = Map[G0 . # . Inverse[G0] &, Association[quadOps]];\nlinOps = Association[Table[\"t11(th1+\" <> ToString[n] <> \"h)\" -> G0 . t2s[th[1] + n hh] . Inverse[G0], {n, -1, 2}]];\nGrid[Prepend[KeyValueMap[{#1, N[singEff[w0 . #2], 5]} &, Join[linOps, conjOps]], {\"one-body operator on site 1 (conjugated by g0)\", \"singlet overlap\"}], Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "### Finding: linear in quantum minors never reaches the singlet; quadratic does (point 2)\n\n- **Any linear combination of single-site quantum minors** (all $1\\times1$ and $2\\times2$, at $x=0,\\pm h$) acting on the $\\langle k_1^{u/h}Q_1\\rangle$ covector: singlet overlap **exactly 0**. Reason: after undoing $g_0$ the singlet needs two units moved into slot 3 (from $(2,1,0)/(1,2,0)$ to $(0,1,2)$); the $k_1$ rotation is pure $E_{12}$; a quantum minor has distinct row indices, so at most one factor $E_{j3}$. (Conjugation by $g_0$ maps the span of minors to itself, so this covers the rotated case.)\n- **Quadratic one-body operators do reach it** (conjugated by $g_0$, as they act before the rotation is undone): $t^{(1)}_{11}(\\theta_1)^2$, $t^{(1)}_{11}(\\theta_1)t^{(1)}_{11}(\\theta_1+2h)$, $t^{(1)}_{11}(\\theta_1-h)t^{(1)}_{11}(\\theta_1+nh)$, fused $t^{(1)}_{22}$ at $\\theta_1-2h,\\theta_1-h,\\theta_1+h$: nonzero. Zero: single $t^{(1)}_{11}$ anywhere, $t^{(1)}_{22}(\\theta_1)$, $t^{(1)}_{22}(\\theta_1+2h)$, $t^{(1)}_{11}(\\theta_1)t^{(1)}_{11}(\\theta_1+h)$.\n- For the adjoint the $\\langle k_2^{u/h}Q_{12}\\rangle$ expansion stops at $m=\\lambda_2=1$ (one $t_{11}$), which is why it misses the singlet. Open: a Q-functional producing a quadratic one-body insertion for $\\lambda_2=1$.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* single-site adjoint Lax L_ij(x) = x delta_ij - h E_ji, site-1 variable x = u - th1; minors at x = 0 as in t11(th1) *)\nLs[i_, j_][x_] := x IdentityMatrix[8] KroneckerDelta[i, j] - hh Ee[1][j, i];\nqm1[{i_}, {j_}][x_] := Ls[i, j][x];\nqm2[{i1_, i2_}, {j1_, j2_}][x_] := Ls[i1, j1][x] . Ls[i2, j2][x - hh] - Ls[i2, j1][x] . Ls[i1, j2][x - hh];\npairs2 = Subsets[Range[3], {2}];\nminors1 = Flatten[Table[qm1[{i}, {j}][0], {i, 3}, {j, 3}], 1];\nminors2 = Flatten[Table[qm2[I2, J2][0], {I2, pairs2}, {J2, pairs2}], 1];\nsingEff[w_] := kron[w, ext[2, True]] . sing;\nw0 = ext[1, True] . MatrixExp[(7/5) Ee[1][1, 2]];\n(* singlet overlaps of w0 . M over each spanning set (all zero <=> no combination reaches it) *)\nsingleSets = <|\"1x1 minors (Lax entries)\" -> minors1, \"2x2 minors\" -> minors2, \"2x2 minors at x = 0, h, -h\" -> Join[minors2, Flatten[Table[qm2[I2, J2][s], {s, {hh, -hh}}, {I2, pairs2}, {J2, pairs2}], 2]]|>;\nprodSet = Flatten[Outer[Dot, minors2, minors2, 1], 1];\nGrid[Join[{{\"one-body operators M\", \"max |singlet overlap of (w0 M) (x) e1|\"}},\n   KeyValueMap[{#1, Max[Abs[singEff[w0 . #] & /@ #2]]} &, singleSets],\n   {{\"products of two 2x2 minors\", N[Max[Abs[singEff[w0 . #] & /@ prodSet]], 4]}}], Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"677717\" data-output-id=\"120\" data-out-n=\"1051\" data-sub-idx=\"12\" data-output-format=\"WLLatex\" data-output-is-graphics=\"0\" data-cell-idx=\"140\" data-sub-start=\"12\" data-sub-end=\"14\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[1051]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered\" data-page-width-em=\"14\" data-latex-b64=\"\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:6.04em;vertical-align:-2.75em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:3.29em;\"><span style=\"top:-5.25em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:5.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:6em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-2.75em;\"></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:3.25em;\"><span style=\"top:-5.41em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">one-body operators M</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.21em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">1x1 minors (Lax entries)</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.01em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">2x2 minors</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-1.81em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">2x2 minors at x = 0, h, -h</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-0.61em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">products of two 2x2 minors</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.75em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:6em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-2.75em;\"></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:3.25em;\"><span style=\"top:-5.41em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">max |singlet overlap of (w0 M) (x) e1|</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.21em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.01em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-1.81em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-0.61em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0.7875</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.75em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:6em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-2.75em;\"></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.5em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:5.25em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.7em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:5.25em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.9em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:5.25em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-6.1em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:5.25em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-7.3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:5.25em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-8.5em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:5.25em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.75em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div></div></div>",
       "mime": "x-application/wolfram-language-html"
      },
