       "data": "Out[1051]= \\begin{array}{|c|c|}\\hline\\text{one-body operators M} & \\text{max |singlet overlap of (w0 M) (x) e1|}\\\\\\hline\\text{1x1 minors (Lax entries)} & 0\\\\\\hline\\text{2x2 minors} & 0\\\\\\hline\\text{2x2 minors at x = 0, h, -h} & 0\\\\\\hline\\text{products of two 2x2 minors} & 0.7875\\\\\\hline\\end{array}",
