  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## P-bilinears on the companion vacuum (2026-09-27)\n\nCompanion-frame expansion $t_{a}(u)=\\sum_{r=0}^{3}\\chi_r P_{a,r}(u)$ ($\\chi_0=1$; $a=1$ fundamental, $a=2$ antisymmetric; $t$ is affine in $\\chi$ because every minor of the companion matrix is). Question: for which $u,v,a,b,r,s$ does\n$$X=P_{a,r}(u)P_{b,s}(v)-P_{b,r}(v)P_{a,s}(u)$$\nsatisfy $\\langle 0|X=\\langle w|\\otimes e_8^T$ with $\\langle 0|=e_8^T\\otimes e_8^T$, adjoint $\\otimes$ adjoint? Self-contained block, names prefixed `pb`, $u,v$ kept symbolic, point 1 ($h=1/3$, $\\theta=(2/7,-5/11)$).",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* adjoint x adjoint, L_ij(u) = u delta_ij - h E_ji, T = L1(u-th1) L2(u-th2), untwisted; twist enters only via G *)\npbh = 1/3; pbth = {2/7, -5/11}; pbE[i_, j_] := pbE[i, j] = JJ[i, j, {2, 1, 0}];\npbL[i_, j_][u_] := u IdentityMatrix[8] KroneckerDelta[i, j] - pbh pbE[j, i];\npbT[i_, j_][u_] := pbT[i, j][u] = Sum[KroneckerProduct[pbL[i, k][u - pbth[[1]]], pbL[k, j][u - pbth[[2]]]], {k, 3}];\npbGc[{c1_, c2_, c3_}] := {{c1, c2, c3}, {1, 0, 0}, {0, 1, 0}};\n(* quantum minor of T.G, same shift convention as QMG in cell 7 *)\npbTG[chi_][{i_, j_}][u_] := Sum[pbT[i, k][u] pbGc[chi][[k, j]], {k, 3}];\npbQM[chi_][Ii_, Jj_][u_] := Sum[Signature[s] (Dot @@ MapIndexed[pbTG[chi][{#1, Jj[[First[#2]]]}][u + pbh - pbh First[#2]] &, s]), {s, Permutations[Ii]}];\npbt[1, chi_][u_] := Sum[pbTG[chi][{i, i}][u], {i, 3}];\npbt[2, chi_][u_] := Sum[pbQM[chi][I2, I2][u], {I2, Subsets[Range[3], {2}]}];\n(* P_{a,0} = t(chi=0), P_{a,r} = t(chi=e_r) - t(chi=0), exact since t is affine in chi *)\npbP[a_, 0][u_] := pbP[a, 0][u] = Expand[pbt[a, {0, 0, 0}][u]];\npbP[a_, r_][u_] := pbP[a, r][u] = Expand[pbt[a, UnitVector[3, r]][u] - pbP[a, 0][u]];\n(* affinity check at a random chi, and commutativity of t at fixed chi *)\n{Expand[pbt[2, {2, -3, 5}][uu] - (pbP[2, 0][uu] + 2 pbP[2, 1][uu] - 3 pbP[2, 2][uu] + 5 pbP[2, 3][uu])] == 0 ConstantArray[0, {64, 64}], With[{A = pbt[1, {2, -3, 5}][1/5], B = pbt[2, {2, -3, 5}][3/7]}, A . B == B . A]}",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"400495\" data-output-id=\"8\" data-out-n=\"117\" data-sub-idx=\"14\" data-output-format=\"WLLatex\" data-output-is-graphics=\"0\" data-cell-idx=\"147\" data-sub-start=\"14\" data-sub-end=\"14\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[117]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered\" data-page-width-em=\"22\" data-latex-b64=\"XGxlZnRce1xtYXRocm17VHJ1ZX0sXG1hdGhybXtUcnVlfVxyaWdodFx9\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">{</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">True</span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">True</span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">}</span></span></span></span></span></span></div></div></div>",
       "mime": "x-application/wolfram-language-html"
      },
      {
       "data": "Out[117]= \\left\\{\\mathrm{True},\\mathrm{True}\\right\\}",
       "mime": "text/plain"
      }
     ],
     "id": "e7d42a15-d466-42f1-97c3-dcc09c8b50f7"
    }
   ],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* <0|X as 8x8 (site1 row, site2 column); localized on site 1 iff columns 1..7 vanish *)\npbvac = Flatten[KroneckerProduct[UnitVector[8, 8], UnitVector[8, 8]]];\npbW[a_, b_, r_, s_] := pbW[a, b, r, s] = ArrayReshape[Expand[(pbvac . pbP[a, r][uu]) . pbP[b, s][vv] - (pbvac . pbP[b, r][vv]) . pbP[a, s][uu]], {8, 8}];\n(* ideal of the off-column conditions, and the ideal where the kept column also vanishes *)\npbOff[a_, b_, r_, s_] := DeleteCases[Flatten[pbW[a, b, r, s][[All, 1 ;; 7]]], 0];\npbKeep[a_, b_, r_, s_] := DeleteCases[pbW[a, b, r, s][[All, 8]], 0];\nAbsoluteTiming[{Length[pbOff[1, 1, 0, 1]], GroebnerBasis[pbOff[1, 1, 0, 1], {uu, vv}] // Factor // Short}]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"400495\" data-output-id=\"9\" data-out-n=\"122\" data-sub-idx=\"6\" data-output-format=\"WLLatex\" data-output-is-graphics=\"0\" data-cell-idx=\"148\" data-sub-start=\"6\" data-sub-end=\"6\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[122]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered\" data-page-width-em=\"21\" data-line-broken=\"1\" data-latex-b64=\"\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:6em;vertical-align:-2.75em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"col-align-r\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:3.25em;\"><span style=\"top:-5.25em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.84em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.75em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.84em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.25em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.84em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-0.75em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.84em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.75em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"col-align-l\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:3.25em;\"><span style=\"top:-5.41em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"to