  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* single P's on the vacuum: where does <0|P_{a,r}(u) localize, and to what? *)\npbSingle[a_, r_] := Module[{m = ArrayReshape[pbvac . pbP[a, r][uu], {8, 8}], off},\n   off = DeleteCases[Flatten[m[[All, 1 ;; 7]]], 0];\n   {{a, r}, If[off === {}, \"all u\", Solve[Thread[off == 0], uu]], Exponent[m[[All, 8]], uu]}];\n(* site-1 covector of each localized bilinear: support in the GT basis (8 = lowest weight) *)\npbSupport[{abrs_, sols_}] := {abrs, Table[{sol, Flatten[Position[Expand[pbW @@ abrs /. sol][[All, 8]], x_ /; x =!= 0, {1}, Heads -> False]]}, {sol, sols}]};\nToString[{Table[pbSingle[a, r], {a, 2}, {r, 0, 3}], pbSupport /@ pbScan} /. {uu -> \"u\", vv -> \"v\"}, InputForm]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
