  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "### Findings: P-bilinears on $e_8\\otimes e_8$\n\nExact, $u,v$ symbolic, the same at points 1 and 2 (the special values are exactly $\\theta_1$ and $\\theta_1+2h$; $\\theta_2$ never appears). GT labels: $e_3=(1,2,0)$, $e_5=(1,1,1)$ ($gl_2$ singlet), $e_7=(0,2,1)$, $e_8=(0,1,2)$ = vacuum.\n\nSingle $P$'s: $\\langle0|P_{1,2}=\\langle0|P_{1,3}=\\langle0|P_{2,3}=0$; $P_{1,1},P_{2,2}$ are eigen on $\\langle0|$; $P_{2,1}(u)$ localizes at $u=\\theta_2,\\theta_1,\\theta_1+2h$ (to $e_7$ at generic support); $P_{2,0}(\\theta_1)$ localizes to span$\\{e_4,e_5\\}$; $P_{1,0}$ never.\n\nNontrivial localizing bilinears $X=P_{a,r}(u)P_{b,s}(v)-P_{b,r}(v)P_{a,s}(u)$, $\\langle0|X=c\\,e_k^T\\otimes e_8^T$ (up to $u\\leftrightarrow v$ / $r\\leftrightarrow s$ relabellings):\n\n| $(a,b,r,s)$ | point | site-1 result |\n|---|---|---|\n| $(1,2,0,1)$ | $v=\\theta_1$, any $u$ | $e_5$, $c\\propto(u-\\theta_1)(u-\\theta_2)$ |\n| $(2,2,0,2)$ | $u=\\theta_1$, any $v$ | $e_5$ |\n| $(2,2,1,2)$ | $u=\\theta_1+2h$, any $v$ | $e_7$ |\n| $(2,2,0,1)$ | $(u,v)=(\\theta_1+2h,\\theta_1)$ or swapped | $e_3$, constant $c$ |\n| $(1,2,1,2)$ | all $u,v$ | $e_8$ (trivial, $\\propto\\langle0|$) |\n\nNo other $(a,b,r,s)$ localizes nontrivially. Note that the $(1,2,0,1)$ bilinear projects $P_{2,0}(\\theta_1)$'s $\\{e_4,e_5\\}$ output onto the pure $gl_2$ singlet $e_5$. The $(2,2,0,1)$ one, $P_{2,0}(\\theta_1+2h)P_{2,1}(\\theta_1)-P_{2,0}(\\theta_1)P_{2,1}(\\theta_1+2h)$, moves site 1 by $\\alpha_{13}+\\alpha_{23}$ to $e_3$.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "### Same scan for $[3,1,0]\\otimes[3,1,0]$\n\nRepresentation-generic version of cells 148–152: `pbRep` sets the site rep, the vacuum is the last GT vector on both sites, and special points are reported as $\\theta_i+nh$.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* rep-generic rescan; n1 = dim of the site rep, vacuum = lowest-weight GT vector on both sites *)\npbRescanRep[rep_, h_, th_] := Module[{n1 = dim[rep], lab},\n   pbh = h; pbth = th; Clear[pbE, pbT, pbP, pbW, pbSols];\n   pbE[i_, j_] := pbE[i, j] = SparseArray[JJ[i, j, rep]];\n   pbL[i_, j_][u_] := u IdentityMatrix[n1, SparseArray] KroneckerDelta[i, j] - pbh pbE[j, i];\n   pbT[i_, j_][u_] := pbT[i, j][u] = Sum[KroneckerProduct[pbL[i, k][u - pbth[[1]]], pbL[k, j][u - pbth[[2]]]], {k, 3}];\n   pbP[a_, 0][u_] := pbP[a, 0][u] = Expand[pbt[a, {0, 0, 0}][u]];\n   pbP[a_, r_][u_] := pbP[a, r][u] = Expand[pbt[a, UnitVector[3, r]][u] - pbP[a, 0][u]];\n   pbvac = Flatten[KroneckerProduct[UnitVector[n1, n1], UnitVector[n1, n1]]];\n   pbW[a_, b_, r_, s_] := pbW[a, b, r, s] = ArrayReshape[Normal[Expand[(pbvac . pbP[a, r][uu]) . pbP[b, s][vv] - (pbvac . pbP[b, r][vv]) . pbP[a, s][uu]]], {n1, n1}];\n   pbOff[a_, b_, r_, s_] := DeleteCases[Flatten[pbW[a, b, r, s][[All, 1 ;; n1 - 1]]], 0];\n   pbKeep[a_, b_, r_, s_] := DeleteCases[pbW[a, b, r, s][[All, n1]], 0];\n   pbSols[a_, b_, r_, s_] := pbSols[a, b, r, s] = Module[{off = pbOff[a, b, r, s], sols}, sols = If[off === {}, {{}}, Solve[Thread[off == 0], {uu, vv}]]; Select[sols, (pbKeep[a, b, r, s] /. #) =!= {} && Simplify[pbKeep[a, b, r, s] /. #] =!= ConstantArray[0, Length[pbKeep[a, b, r, s] /. #]] &]];\n   lab[val_] := Module[{n}, Catch[Do[n = (val - th[[i]])/h; If[IntegerQ[n], Throw[\"th\" <> ToString[i] <> If[n == 0, \"\", If[n > 0, \"+\", \"\"] <> ToString[n] <> \"h\"]]], {i, 2}]; val]];\n   Flatten[Table[If[pbSols[a, b, r, s] === {}, Nothing, {{a, b, r, s}, pbSols[a, b, r, s] /. (x_ -> val_) :> (x -> lab[val]), Flatten[Position[Expand[pbW[a, b, r, s] /. First[pbSols[a, b, r, s]]][[All, n1]], x_ /; x =!= 0, {1}, Heads -> False]]}], {a, 2}, {b, 2}, {r, 0, 3}, {s, 0, 3}], 3]];\n(* sanity: reproduces the adjoint scan, then time one [3,1,0] piece before the full scan *)\n{pbRescanRep[{2, 1, 0}, 1/3, {2/7, -5/11}][[All, 1 ;; 2]] === pbScan1, AbsoluteTiming[pbRescanRep[{3, 1, 0}, 1/3, {2/7, -5/11}]; Length[pbOff[2, 2, 0, 1]]]}",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
